MODULE Nora18;  (* NORA 18 (24 Nov 2026, Pixipogo 49 and Ozana 5). Pion: "on the other sites the video does not start, I
     think she does not know which engine to use", and "all of them" (share, the private tab, the saved pages, the sites as
     a computer). Now:
     1. A picture of the free films that leads to a film plays it (before, it opened the picture big). And when the film
        cannot play in her player (its server gives it in a way the phone's player does not take, or no file at all), she
        opens the film's own page in the window into the whole web, with that server's own player.
     2. A finger held on a link: NEW TAB, COPY, SHARE, PRIVATE (a private tab). Held on the address bar: SAVE, COPY,
        SHARE, COMPUTER / PHONE (how the window into the whole web asks for the sites).
     3. PRIVATE TABS: what you see there does not go into the history; their square is gold.
     4. SAVED PAGES (nora:saved, on the start page): a page kept on the phone, to read without the net (up to 20).
     5. SHARE: the phone's own Share (WhatsApp, mail ...). The window ecran-cubn49.dex: "share TEXT", "desk 1|0".
   NORA 17 (24 Nov 2026, Pixipogo 48 and Ozana 4). Pion: "I think we lack the tabs, the download and all
     that Chrome does". Now:
     1. TABS: up to 8. The little square with a number at the top (next to her name) shows them all: tap one to go to it,
        X closes it, NEW TAB opens the start page. Each tab keeps its page, its place on it and its own BACK.
     2. A finger held on a link: NEW TAB, COPY or CANCEL (before, it only copied).
     3. DOWNLOADS of any size, with the phone's own downloader, to the Download folder, with its notification (the
        window ecran-cubn48.dex: "get NAME URL"); the files asked for in the window into the whole web go there too.
   NORA 16 (24 Nov 2026, Pixipogo 47 and Ozana 3). Pion: "both, as usual" (and "I would not ask you to
     break ethics anyway"). Two ways to the films beyond YouTube's own player, both clean:
     1. NEWPIPE: in the window into the whole web, a YouTube film has a fourth button, NEWPIPE: the address goes to the
        NewPipe app, if it is on the phone (the window ecran-cubn47.dex: "app PACKAGE URL"). Other sites: APP, the
        phone's own app for them.
     2. FILMS GIVEN FREELY (nora:films, and Filme1): PeerTube (through Sepia Search), the Internet Archive and Wikimedia
        Commons give their films on purpose. Nora asks their search in JSON, Filme1 reads it in Oberon and makes a page
        of pictures and titles; a title plays the film in the player of the window. In the address bar:
          pt cats    on PeerTube         ia popeye    on the Internet Archive         wc volcano    on Wikimedia Commons
   NORA 15 (24 Nov 2026, Pixipogo 46 and Ozana 2). Pion: "a browser without YouTube and TikTok is worth
     nothing today; can you show the opposite?" YouTube and TikTok are all JavaScript: there is no page of words to read
     and no film file to give, so Nora cannot read them herself. She opens them in a WINDOW INTO THE WHOLE WEB instead:
     the window ecran-cubn46.dex has a box (NoraWeb) where the phone's own web engine runs the site and its own player,
     between Nora's address bar and her buttons. A link or an address of youtube.com, youtu.be, tiktok.com, vimeo.com
     or twitch.tv opens there by itself. Below: BACK (back in the box; at the first page it closes), CLOSE, RELOAD.
     The phone's BACK key goes back in the box too. Everything else stays Nora's own, read in Oberon.
   NORA 14 (24 Nov 2026, Pixipogo 45 and Ozana 1). Pion: "make a separate browser app named Ozana
     (that is, she stays a fairy)". The same fairy, two homes: in Pixipogo she is Nora, and in the app Ozana she is
     called Ozana (SetName) and lives alone (Alone): there is no HOME to go back to, so that button is HISTORY.
     Her pictures are smoother too (Pic6: the colours of JPEG and WEBP from their 4 nearest samples, and the loop
     filter of WEBP). The films and the sounds play as in Nora 9 (the player of the window).
   NORA 13 (24 Nov 2026, Pixipogo 44). Pion: "to the video card". The pictures are no more
     little squares: Pic5 reads them whole (up to 800 pixels on a side in the page, 1200 seen big), OllGL7 gives
     their pixels to the graphics card once (a texture in a slot: the 40 pictures of the page in slots 0 .. 39, the
     big one in slot 40), and every frame each picture costs two triangles, drawn by the card at the real
     resolution of the screen. On a window without textures (older than ecran-cubn44.dex) the squares are as before.
   NORA 12 (24 Nov 2026, Pixipogo 43). Pion: "let only Nora stay, take out chick, it is forced".
     So she is NORA again, everywhere she says her name. And the progressive JPEG photos (The Guardian, most news
     sites) come whole now, not as the means of their 8 x 8 blocks (Pic4).
   NORACHICK 11 (23 Nov 2026, Pixipogo 42): the pictures of the news sites, WEBP, come too (Pic4).
   NORACHICK 10 (23 Nov 2026, Pixipogo 41). Pion: "of course" (to find, downloads, history):
     1. FIND IN PAGE: tap the address bar, CLEAR, write a word, FIND IN PAGE. Every place is marked; the bar at the
        bottom says 3 / 17, < and > go from one to the next, X closes it. Small and capital letters are alike, and
        "s" finds "ș" too (the Romanian letters are found from their plain ones).
     2. DOWNLOADS: a link to a file (.pdf .zip .apk .epub .mod .txt.gz ...) does not open as a page: the file goes to
        Download/CubicumN on the phone (through the window, as the files of FILES go). At most 4 MB (the window keeps
        no more of an answer).
     3. HISTORY: the last 50 pages, in nora-hist.txt. The newest 8 are on the start page ("Lately"), all of them on
        nora:history, and "Forget them all" empties it.
   NORACHICK 9 (23 Nov 2026, Pixipogo 39). Pion: "let me see a video" (YouTube cannot: it is all
     JavaScript, there is no film file to give). The films that ARE files play: <video> and <audio> of a page
     (Wikipedia and Commons: WebM), and links to .mp4 .webm .m4v .mp3 .m4a .ogg .opus.
     In the page a film is its poster with a round PLAY on it (or a PLAY button when it has no poster); a tap
     plays it, in the player of the window (Juno's), straight from the net: the window ecran-cubn39.dex
     (NoraVid: "play URL x y w h W H" streams an address). Below: CLOSE, PAUSE / PLAY, and the line of the
     film (a tap on it goes there). Ogg Theora films cannot play on Android; the player says so.
   NORACHICK 8 (23 Nov 2026, Pixipogo 38). Pion: "do what you said" (after the cats of Wikipedia):
     - tap a picture: it opens BIG, over the whole screen, with up to 120 squares on a side (the page has 64).
       Below: CLOSE, LINK (where the picture leads, if it is a link) and COPY (its address). The 64 one shows
       at once, the big one comes over it a moment later.
     - GIF (the first picture of it) and progressive JPEG are read too (Pic4).
     A picture is now always a picture: a tap opens it; its link is the LINK button of the big view.
   NORACHICK 7 (23 Nov 2026, Pixipogo 37): PICTURES, the fourth thing Pion chose.
     After the words come, NoraChick asks the window for the pictures of the page one by one (the Web1 files:
     web.txt "ID GET URL", web.dat), and Pic1 reads them here in Oberon: JPEG (baseline) and PNG (all kinds,
     interlaced too). Each picture is drawn as at most 64 x 64 little squares, as wide as on a computer screen
     (narrower than the screen) and never wider than the page. Pictures already seen stay in memory (40 of them),
     so BACK shows them at once. A picture smaller than 24 x 24 (icons) is left out; GIF, WEBP and progressive
     JPEG say so in a line, with their alt text. Hold a finger on a picture: its address is copied.
     And a page that says <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="4"> (Marginalia's "Wait For A Moment") comes again
     by itself after those seconds (5 times at most in a row).
   NORACHICK 6 (23 Nov 2026, Pixipogo 36). Pion: "now I see I have no copy paste in Nora".
     Hold a finger still on the page (0.6 s): on a link it copies the link, on text the whole paragraph,
     on the address bar the address. Where you write (the address bar, a field of a form): PASTE, COPY, CLEAR.
     Through the window's clipboard files (clip-out.txt + clip-go; clip-req -> clip-in.txt), so the window stays
     ecran-cubn33.dex. What you paste comes without diacritics (the window gives it in ASCII); what you copy keeps them.
     Her name is size 3 now: the star sat on the "k" (Pion's screenshot); the "..." went, the bar under the address
     shows the loading. A textarea is 16 letters wide, like the other fields (at A+ it went past the screen).
   NORACHICK 5 (23 Nov 2026, Pixipogo 35). Pion: "until then we refine the browser and Pixipogo";
     he chose all four: your pages, instant BACK, forms, pictures. Here are the first three (pictures come next):
     1. YOUR PAGES: the star in the top right saves the page (gold = saved; tap again = out). They are on the
        start page, in nora-marks.txt ("URL TITLE" on each line).
     2. Instant BACK: every page that comes is kept as it came, in nc0.htm .. nc23.htm. BACK reads it from there,
        without the net, and puts you back where you were on the page.
     3. FORMS: fields to write in (tap = keyboard), passwords as stars, checkboxes, radio buttons, lists (tap = the
        next choice), and the buttons that send. GET goes through net.txt as before; POST goes through the Web1
        files (web.txt + web-body.txt, the answer in web.dat), so the window stays ecran-cubn33.dex.
        ENTER sends the form when it has only one field to write in; otherwise X keeps what you wrote, and you
        press the button of the form.
   NORACHICK 4 (23 Nov 2026, Pixipogo 34). Pion: "NoraChick (Charon hides behind ick)", and 1 + 2:
     1. her own letters: small letters with descenders (g j p q y), the Romanian ones (a with breve, a and i with
        circumflex, s and t with comma, small and capital), and the signs the old font had not (; ' " [ ] { } _ | & @ # $).
        Still 5 x 7, the same capitals and digits as OllGL6, drawn by NoraChick herself (OllGL6 stays as it is).
     2. A- and A+ in the top right: the size of the text (2, 3 or 4), kept in nora.cfg.
     Inside, the Romanian letters are the codes 128..137 (a-breve a-circ i-circ s-comma t-comma, then the capitals).
   NORA 3 (23 Nov 2026, Pixipogo 33): she has the net (Pion's screenshots: Wikipedia, CNN lite).
     The search goes to old-search.marginalia.nu, made for text browsers (the new one asks to wait 2 s, for bots).
     A comma or a dot right after a link sits next to it again ("BUCURESTI, AI" and not "BUCURESTI , AI").
     Window ecran-cubn33.dex (NoraNet2: NORA and Web1 for any program).
   NORA 2 (23 Nov 2026, Pixipogo 32): the search is Marginalia, the Swedish one with its own index
     (Pion: "I'd rather have the Swedish one"; not DuckDuckGo). "w words" searches Wikipedia in Romanian.
     The signs the 5 x 7 font has not: ; -> ,  [ { -> (  ] } -> )  _ -> -  | -> /  & -> +, quotes left out
     (in NORA 1 "it; a" showed as "it  a"). The net comes with the window ecran-cubn32.dex.
   NORA 1 (23 Nov 2026, Pixipogo 31): the browser of the court. Pion: "I want Pixipogo with its own
     browser and that's it. We already have a text browser in Eula, so I know it can be done."
     The name is the old one, Nora-hc (Charon backwards); here she is a fairy of Oberon.
     How a page comes:
       NORA writes net.txt ("ID URL") and net-go; the host (the window) fetches the page over HTTPS, follows the
       redirects, turns its letters into UTF-8 and writes net.html, then net-ok.txt:
         "1 ID CODE FINAL-URL"   the page is in net.html
         "0 ID WHY ..."          it did not come
       A reply with an old ID is thrown away (BACK pressed while a page was coming).
     What NORA does with it, all here in Oberon: reads net.html once, byte by byte, and keeps only what you read:
       headings, paragraphs, lists, links, the alt text of pictures. script, style, nav, footer, aside, form,
       button, svg, iframe go away whole. Letters with accents become their plain letter (the 5 x 7 font has no
       others), entities like &amp; &#351; &#x219; are decoded. Then the words are laid out in rows for this screen.
     Screen: the address bar (tap = keyboard; an address, or words = a search on DuckDuckGo Lite), the page
     (drag = scroll, tap on a link = go there), BACK . HOME . START at the bottom.
     With no host (bare metal) NORA says so; with a window that does not know net-go she waits 30 s and says so.
   Pion & Claude, 23.11.2026 *)

  IMPORT Ecran, Fisier, Ceas, OllGL6, OllGL7, Grafica, Keys1, Gazda4, Desk6, Pic6, Filme1;

  CONST
    PM = 400000;   (* letters of the words of one page *)
    NW = 60000;    (* words *)
    NL = 2000;     (* links *)
    LL = 600;      (* letters of an address (a form sent with GET makes long ones) *)
    NR = 40000;    (* rows *)
    NH = 32;       (* pages behind (BACK) *)
    MT = 8;        (* tabs *)
    NSV = 20;      (* saved pages *)
    NC = 24;       (* pages kept on disk for BACK *)
    NM = 100;      (* your pages *)
    NF = 300;      (* fields of the forms of one page *)
    NFO = 64;      (* forms of one page *)
    NI = 40;       (* pictures kept in memory *)
    CELLS = 4096;  (* 64 * 64: the squares of one picture of the page *)
    BIG = 120;     (* the squares on a side of a picture seen big (no textures) *)
    PAGEPX = 800;  (* with textures: the most pixels on a side of a picture of the page *)
    BIGPX = 1200;  (* and of one seen big *)
    BIGTEX = 40;   (* its slot *)
    NV = 30;       (* films of one page *)
    NHI = 50;      (* pages in the history *)
    NHIT = 500;    (* places found in a page *)
    NO = 1500;     (* the choices of the lists of one page *)
    TOP = 168;     (* where the page starts on the screen *)
    MX = 20;       (* the margin *)
    kText = 0; kHead = 1; kSub = 2; kField = 3; kImg = 4; kVid = 5; kPara = 6; kLine = 7;   (* kinds of words; 6 and 7 are breaks *)
    idle = 0; asking = 1; arrived = 2;
    fkHidden = 0; fkText = 1; fkPass = 2; fkArea = 3; fkCheck = 4; fkRadio = 5; fkSelect = 6; fkSubmit = 7;

  VAR
    W, H: INTEGER;
    pool: ARRAY PM OF CHAR; np: INTEGER;
    wS, wL, wK, wA, wX, wF: ARRAY NW OF INTEGER; nw: INTEGER;   (* start in pool, length, kind, link (-1 = none), x, field (-1) *)
    links: ARRAY NL, LL OF CHAR; nl: INTEGER;
    rW0, rW1, rY, rM: ARRAY NR OF INTEGER; nr, totalH: INTEGER;   (* rows: first word, after the last, y, size *)
    url, base, title, want, edit: ARRAY LL OF CHAR;
    hist: ARRAY NH, LL OF CHAR; histS, histY: ARRAY NH OF INTEGER; nh: INTEGER;   (* the page, where it is kept, the scroll *)
    slotUrl: ARRAY NC, LL OF CHAR; nextSlot, curSlot, teeH: INTEGER;   (* the pages kept for BACK *)
    src: ARRAY 16 OF CHAR;   (* where the page that came is: net.html, or web.dat after a POST *)
    posting: BOOLEAN;
    mU: ARRAY NM, LL OF CHAR; mT: ARRAY NM, 64 OF CHAR; nmk: INTEGER;   (* your pages *)
    (* the forms *)
    frAct: ARRAY NFO, LL OF CHAR; frPost: ARRAY NFO OF BOOLEAN; nfo: INTEGER;
    fForm, fKind, fW, fOpt0, fNOpt, fSel: ARRAY NF OF INTEGER; fOn: ARRAY NF OF BOOLEAN;
    fName, fLabel: ARRAY NF, 64 OF CHAR; fVal: ARRAY NF, LL OF CHAR; nf: INTEGER;
    oVal: ARRAY NO, 80 OF CHAR; oText: ARRAY NO, 48 OF CHAR; no: INTEGER;
    curForm, inSelect, inOption, inButton, ef: INTEGER;   (* ef: the field being written (-1 = the address bar) *)
    pasteT, tDown: INTEGER; longDone: BOOLEAN;   (* waiting for the clipboard since pasteT (0 = not); the long press *)
    optHasVal: BOOLEAN;
    rHt: ARRAY NR OF INTEGER;   (* the height of each row: a row of words, or a picture *)
    (* the pictures: a word of kind kImg has its picture in wS *)
    iUrl: ARRAY NI, LL OF CHAR; iAlt: ARRAY NI, 64 OF CHAR; iWhy: ARRAY NI, 24 OF CHAR;
    iSt, iW, iH, iCw, iCh, iAw, iAh, iUse: ARRAY NI OF INTEGER;   (* iSt: 0 free, 1 to ask, 2 asked, 3 here, 4 cannot *)
    iPix: ARRAY NI * CELLS OF INTEGER;
    pageGen, imgId, imgSlot, tImg, tImgPoll: INTEGER; imgBusy: BOOLEAN;
    refreshAt, nRefresh: INTEGER; refreshUrl: ARRAY LL OF CHAR;   (* <meta http-equiv="refresh"> *)
    (* the big view *)
    viewing: BOOLEAN; vSlot, vLink, vSt, vCw, vCh: INTEGER;   (* vSt: 1 to ask, 2 asked, 3 here, 4 cannot *)
    vPix: ARRAY BIG * BIG OF INTEGER;
    vTex: BOOLEAN; iTex: ARRAY NI OF BOOLEAN;   (* on the graphics card *)
    name: ARRAY 16 OF CHAR; alone: BOOLEAN;      (* "Nora" in Pixipogo; "Ozana" in her own app *)
    webOn: BOOLEAN; webUrl: ARRAY LL OF CHAR; webProg, webBack, tWeb, tWebStart: INTEGER;   (* the window into the whole web *)
    resolving: BOOLEAN; resWant: ARRAY LL OF CHAR;   (* asking where the file of a free film is (nora:play?) *)
    ntab, ctab: INTEGER; tabsOn, menuOn: BOOLEAN; menuUrl: ARRAY LL OF CHAR;   (* the tabs; the menu of a link held *)
    menuKind: INTEGER;   (* 1 a link, 2 the page (the address bar held) *)
    priv, desk: BOOLEAN; tPriv: ARRAY MT OF BOOLEAN;   (* a private tab; the window into the whole web as a computer *)
    resWatch, fallWeb: ARRAY LL OF CHAR;   (* the film's own page, if her player cannot play it *)
    nsv: INTEGER; svU: ARRAY NSV, LL OF CHAR; svT: ARRAY NSV, 64 OF CHAR; svN: ARRAY NSV OF INTEGER;   (* saved pages *)
    tUrl, tTitle: ARRAY MT, LL OF CHAR; tSlot, tScroll, tNh: ARRAY MT OF INTEGER;
    tHist: ARRAY MT * NH, LL OF CHAR; tHistS, tHistY: ARRAY MT * NH OF INTEGER;
    (* the films: a word of kind kVid has its film in wS *)
    mdUrl: ARRAY NV, LL OF CHAR; mdPost: ARRAY NV OF INTEGER; mdAud: ARRAY NV OF BOOLEAN; nmd: INTEGER;
    inMedia, medAud: BOOLEAN; medUrl, medPoster: ARRAY LL OF CHAR;   (* the <video> or <audio> being read *)
    hiU: ARRAY NHI, LL OF CHAR; hiT: ARRAY NHI, 64 OF CHAR; nhi: INTEGER;   (* the history, the newest first *)
    fq: ARRAY 64 OF CHAR; fHit: ARRAY NHIT OF INTEGER; wHit: ARRAY NW OF BOOLEAN;   (* find in page *)
    nHit, curHit, fWords: INTEGER; finding: BOOLEAN;
    dlUrl: ARRAY LL OF CHAR; dlName: ARRAY 64 OF CHAR; dlSt, dlSize: INTEGER;   (* a download: 1 to ask, 2 asked, 3 saving *)
    playing: BOOLEAN; plUrl, pendPlay: ARRAY LL OF CHAR; plAud: BOOLEAN; plSt, plPos, plDur, tPl, tPlStart: INTEGER;
    state, reqId, tAsk, tPoll, ecur, scroll, scroll0, x0, y0, hw, tMsg: INTEGER;
    down, moved, editing, kdown: BOOLEAN;
    msg: ARRAY 64 OF CHAR;
    (* the reader of net.html *)
    fh, pushed, curStart, curLen, curKind, curA, inA, head, skipDepth, tpos: INTEGER;
    inTitle, inPre, closing, selfc: BOOLEAN;
    tb: ARRAY 1200 OF CHAR;   (* the tag being read, without < and > *)
    tname, skipName: ARRAY 16 OF CHAR;
    linkc, press, white, gold, panel, red, muted, bgk, hitNow, hitOld: INTEGER;
    fA, fB: ARRAY 256 OF INTEGER;   (* the font: rows -2..3 and 4..8 of each letter, 5 bits a row *)
    ts: INTEGER;                    (* the size of the text: 2, 3, 4 *)

  (* ---------- little helpers ---------- *)

  PROCEDURE Len(VAR s: ARRAY OF CHAR): INTEGER;
    VAR k: INTEGER;
  BEGIN k := 0; WHILE (k < LEN(s)) & (s[k] # 0X) DO INC(k) END
    RETURN k
  END Len;

  PROCEDURE Copy(s: ARRAY OF CHAR; VAR d: ARRAY OF CHAR);
    VAR i: INTEGER;
  BEGIN i := 0; WHILE (i < LEN(s)) & (s[i] # 0X) & (i < LEN(d) - 1) DO d[i] := s[i]; INC(i) END; d[i] := 0X
  END Copy;

  PROCEDURE Add(VAR s: ARRAY OF CHAR; t: ARRAY OF CHAR);
    VAR i, k: INTEGER;
  BEGIN k := Len(s); i := 0; WHILE (i < LEN(t)) & (t[i] # 0X) & (k < LEN(s) - 1) DO s[k] := t[i]; INC(k); INC(i) END; s[k] := 0X
  END Add;

  PROCEDURE AddC(VAR s: ARRAY OF CHAR; c: CHAR);
    VAR k: INTEGER;
  BEGIN k := Len(s); IF k < LEN(s) - 1 THEN s[k] := c; s[k + 1] := 0X END
  END AddC;

  PROCEDURE Same(VAR a: ARRAY OF CHAR; b: ARRAY OF CHAR): BOOLEAN;
    VAR i: INTEGER; ok: BOOLEAN;
  BEGIN
    i := 0; ok := TRUE;
    WHILE ok & (i < LEN(b)) & (b[i] # 0X) DO IF (i >= LEN(a)) OR (a[i] # b[i]) THEN ok := FALSE END; INC(i) END;
    IF ok & (i < LEN(a)) & (a[i] # 0X) THEN ok := FALSE END
    RETURN ok
  END Same;

  PROCEDURE Low(c: CHAR): CHAR;
  BEGIN IF (c >= "A") & (c <= "Z") THEN c := CHR(ORD(c) + 32) END
    RETURN c
  END Low;

  PROCEDURE Starts(VAR s: ARRAY OF CHAR; p: ARRAY OF CHAR): BOOLEAN;   (* s starts with p, small or capital letters alike *)
    VAR i: INTEGER; ok: BOOLEAN;
  BEGIN
    i := 0; ok := TRUE;
    WHILE ok & (i < LEN(p)) & (p[i] # 0X) DO IF (i >= LEN(s)) OR (Low(s[i]) # p[i]) THEN ok := FALSE END; INC(i) END
    RETURN ok
  END Starts;

  PROCEDURE Find(VAR s: ARRAY OF CHAR; p: ARRAY OF CHAR; from: INTEGER): INTEGER;   (* where p is in s; -1 *)
    VAR i, k, r: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    r := -1; i := from;
    WHILE (r < 0) & (i < LEN(s)) & (s[i] # 0X) DO
      k := 0; WHILE (k < LEN(p)) & (p[k] # 0X) & (i + k < LEN(s)) & (s[i + k] = p[k]) DO INC(k) END;
      IF (k >= LEN(p)) OR (p[k] = 0X) THEN r := i END;
      INC(i)
    END
    RETURN r
  END Find;

  PROCEDURE Cut(VAR s: ARRAY OF CHAR; at, n: INTEGER);   (* takes n letters out of s at at *)
    VAR i: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    i := at; WHILE (i + n < LEN(s)) & (s[i + n] # 0X) DO s[i] := s[i + n]; INC(i) END;
    IF i < LEN(s) THEN s[i] := 0X END
  END Cut;

  PROCEDURE Say(s: ARRAY OF CHAR);
  BEGIN Copy(s, msg); tMsg := 110
  END Say;

  PROCEDURE Signal(nm: ARRAY OF CHAR);
    VAR h: INTEGER;
  BEGIN h := Fisier.Creeaza(nm); IF h >= 0 THEN Fisier.Scrie(h, 49); Fisier.Gata(h) END
  END Signal;

  PROCEDURE Put(h: INTEGER; s: ARRAY OF CHAR);
    VAR i: INTEGER;
  BEGIN i := 0; WHILE (i < LEN(s)) & (s[i] # 0X) DO Fisier.Scrie(h, ORD(s[i]) MOD 256); INC(i) END
  END Put;

  PROCEDURE PutN(h, n: INTEGER);
    VAR d: ARRAY 12 OF CHAR; k: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    k := 0; IF n < 0 THEN n := 0 END;
    REPEAT d[k] := CHR(ORD("0") + n MOD 10); n := n DIV 10; INC(k) UNTIL n = 0;
    WHILE k > 0 DO DEC(k); Fisier.Scrie(h, ORD(d[k])) END
  END PutN;

  (* ---------- the words ---------- *)

  PROCEDURE ClearHits;   (* nothing found, nothing marked *)
    VAR i, k: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    FOR i := 0 TO nHit - 1 DO FOR k := 0 TO fWords - 1 DO IF fHit[i] + k < NW THEN wHit[fHit[i] + k] := FALSE END END END;
    nHit := 0; curHit := 0; finding := FALSE
  END ClearHits;

  PROCEDURE Reset;
  BEGIN
    np := 0; nw := 0; nl := 0; nr := 0; totalH := 0; title[0] := 0X;
    curLen := 0; inA := -1; head := 0; skipDepth := 0; inTitle := FALSE; inPre := FALSE; pushed := -2;
    nfo := 0; nf := 0; no := 0; curForm := -1; inSelect := -1; inOption := -1; inButton := -1;
    INC(pageGen); refreshAt := 0; nmd := 0; inMedia := FALSE;
    ClearHits
  END Reset;

  PROCEDURE EndWord;
  BEGIN
    IF (curLen > 0) & (nw < NW) THEN wS[nw] := curStart; wL[nw] := curLen; wK[nw] := curKind; wA[nw] := curA; wF[nw] := -1; INC(nw) END;
    curLen := 0
  END EndWord;

  PROCEDURE FieldWord(f, chars: INTEGER);   (* a field of a form, as one word of chars letters *)
  BEGIN
    EndWord;
    IF nw < NW THEN wS[nw] := 0; wL[nw] := chars; wK[nw] := kField; wA[nw] := -1; wF[nw] := f; fW[f] := nw; INC(nw) END
  END FieldWord;

  PROCEDURE Collect(VAR s: ARRAY OF CHAR; c: CHAR);   (* a letter into s; never two spaces, none first *)
    VAR k: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    k := Len(s);
    IF (k < LEN(s) - 1) & ~((c = " ") & ((k = 0) OR (s[k - 1] = " "))) THEN s[k] := c; s[k + 1] := 0X END
  END Collect;

  PROCEDURE Break(k: INTEGER);   (* the end of a line (kLine) or of a paragraph (kPara); never two in a row *)
  BEGIN
    EndWord;
    IF nw > 0 THEN
      IF wK[nw - 1] >= kPara THEN IF k = kPara THEN wK[nw - 1] := kPara END
      ELSIF nw < NW THEN wS[nw] := 0; wL[nw] := 0; wK[nw] := k; wA[nw] := -1; wF[nw] := -1; INC(nw)
      END
    END
  END Break;

  PROCEDURE Emit(c: CHAR);   (* one letter of the page; a space ends the word *)
  BEGIN
    IF inTitle THEN Collect(title, c)
    ELSIF inOption >= 0 THEN Collect(oText[inOption], c)
    ELSIF inSelect >= 0 THEN   (* between the choices of a list: nothing *)
    ELSIF inMedia THEN   (* "your browser cannot play this": NoraChick can *)
    ELSIF inButton >= 0 THEN Collect(fLabel[inButton], c)
    ELSIF c = " " THEN EndWord
    ELSIF np < PM - 1 THEN
      IF curLen >= 150 THEN EndWord END;
      IF curLen = 0 THEN
        curStart := np; curA := inA;
        IF head = 1 THEN curKind := kHead ELSIF head = 2 THEN curKind := kSub ELSE curKind := kText END
      END;
      pool[np] := c; INC(np); INC(curLen)
    END
  END Emit;

  PROCEDURE EmitS(s: ARRAY OF CHAR);
    VAR i: INTEGER;
  BEGIN i := 0; WHILE (i < LEN(s)) & (s[i] # 0X) DO Emit(s[i]); INC(i) END
  END EmitS;

  PROCEDURE Up(c: CHAR; up: BOOLEAN): CHAR;
  BEGIN IF up THEN c := CHR(ORD(c) - 32) END
    RETURN c
  END Up;

  PROCEDURE Map(cp: INTEGER): CHAR;   (* a letter of Unicode -> what NoraChick can draw; 0X = nothing *)
    VAR c: CHAR; up: BOOLEAN;
  BEGIN
    c := 0X;
    up := ((cp >= 0C0H) & (cp <= 0DEH)) OR ((cp >= 100H) & (cp < 180H) & ~ODD(cp));
    IF (cp >= 32) & (cp < 127) THEN c := CHR(cp)
    ELSIF cp = 103H THEN c := CHR(128) ELSIF cp = 0E2H THEN c := CHR(129) ELSIF cp = 0EEH THEN c := CHR(130)
    ELSIF (cp = 219H) OR (cp = 15FH) THEN c := CHR(131) ELSIF (cp = 21BH) OR (cp = 163H) THEN c := CHR(132)
    ELSIF cp = 102H THEN c := CHR(133) ELSIF cp = 0C2H THEN c := CHR(134) ELSIF cp = 0CEH THEN c := CHR(135)
    ELSIF (cp = 218H) OR (cp = 15EH) THEN c := CHR(136) ELSIF (cp = 21AH) OR (cp = 162H) THEN c := CHR(137)
    ELSIF (cp = 9) OR (cp = 10) OR (cp = 13) OR (cp = 0A0H) OR ((cp >= 2000H) & (cp <= 200AH)) OR (cp = 202FH) THEN c := " "
    ELSIF ((cp >= 0C0H) & (cp <= 0C5H)) OR ((cp >= 0E0H) & (cp <= 0E5H)) OR ((cp >= 100H) & (cp <= 105H)) THEN c := Up("a", up)
    ELSIF (cp = 0C7H) OR (cp = 0E7H) OR ((cp >= 106H) & (cp <= 10DH)) THEN c := Up("c", up)
    ELSIF ((cp >= 0C8H) & (cp <= 0CBH)) OR ((cp >= 0E8H) & (cp <= 0EBH)) OR ((cp >= 112H) & (cp <= 11BH)) THEN c := Up("e", up)
    ELSIF ((cp >= 0CCH) & (cp <= 0CFH)) OR ((cp >= 0ECH) & (cp <= 0EFH)) OR ((cp >= 128H) & (cp <= 131H)) THEN c := Up("i", up)
    ELSIF (cp = 0D1H) OR (cp = 0F1H) OR ((cp >= 143H) & (cp <= 148H)) THEN c := Up("n", (cp = 0D1H) OR ((cp >= 143H) & ODD(cp)))
    ELSIF ((cp >= 0D2H) & (cp <= 0D6H)) OR ((cp >= 0F2H) & (cp <= 0F6H)) OR (cp = 0D8H) OR (cp = 0F8H) OR ((cp >= 14CH) & (cp <= 151H)) THEN c := Up("o", up)
    ELSIF ((cp >= 0D9H) & (cp <= 0DCH)) OR ((cp >= 0F9H) & (cp <= 0FCH)) OR ((cp >= 168H) & (cp <= 173H)) THEN c := Up("u", up)
    ELSIF (cp = 0DDH) OR (cp = 0FDH) OR (cp = 0FFH) THEN c := Up("y", cp = 0DDH)
    ELSIF cp = 0DFH THEN c := "s"
    ELSIF (cp >= 15AH) & (cp <= 161H) THEN c := Up("s", up)
    ELSIF ((cp >= 162H) & (cp <= 165H)) THEN c := Up("t", up)
    ELSIF (cp >= 179H) & (cp <= 17EH) THEN c := Up("z", (cp = 179H) OR (cp = 17BH) OR (cp = 17DH))
    ELSIF (cp = 141H) OR (cp = 142H) THEN c := Up("l", cp = 141H)
    ELSIF ((cp >= 2010H) & (cp <= 2015H)) OR (cp = 2212H) OR (cp = 2022H) THEN c := "-"
    ELSIF (cp = 2018H) OR (cp = 2019H) OR (cp = 201AH) OR (cp = 0B4H) THEN c := 27X
    ELSIF (cp = 201CH) OR (cp = 201DH) OR (cp = 201EH) OR (cp = 0ABH) OR (cp = 0BBH) THEN c := 22X
    ELSIF (cp = 2026H) OR (cp = 0B7H) THEN c := "."
    ELSIF cp = 0D7H THEN c := "x"
    END
    RETURN c
  END Map;

  PROCEDURE PutCp(cp: INTEGER);
    VAR c: CHAR;
  BEGIN
    c := Map(cp);
    IF (cp = 10) & inPre THEN Break(kLine) ELSIF c # 0X THEN Emit(c) END
  END PutCp;

  (* ---------- reading net.html ---------- *)

  PROCEDURE Next(): INTEGER;   (* the next byte; -1 at the end *)
    VAR r: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    IF pushed # -2 THEN r := pushed; pushed := -2
    ELSE r := Fisier.Citeste(fh); IF (r >= 0) & (teeH >= 0) THEN Fisier.Scrie(teeH, r) END   (* kept for BACK *)
    END
    RETURN r
  END Next;

  PROCEDURE IsLetter(c: INTEGER): BOOLEAN;
  BEGIN RETURN ((c >= ORD("a")) & (c <= ORD("z"))) OR ((c >= ORD("A")) & (c <= ORD("Z")))
  END IsLetter;

  PROCEDURE IsAlnum(c: INTEGER): BOOLEAN;
  BEGIN RETURN IsLetter(c) OR ((c >= ORD("0")) & (c <= ORD("9")))
  END IsAlnum;

  PROCEDURE ReadUtf(b: INTEGER);   (* a letter that starts with byte b (UTF-8) *)
    VAR n, c, cp: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    IF b < 80H THEN PutCp(b)
    ELSE
      IF b >= 0F0H THEN n := 3; cp := b MOD 8 ELSIF b >= 0E0H THEN n := 2; cp := b MOD 16
      ELSIF b >= 0C0H THEN n := 1; cp := b MOD 32 ELSE n := 0; cp := -1
      END;
      WHILE n > 0 DO
        c := Next();
        IF (c >= 80H) & (c < 0C0H) THEN cp := cp * 64 + c - 80H; DEC(n) ELSE pushed := c; cp := -1; n := 0 END
      END;
      IF cp >= 0 THEN PutCp(cp) END
    END
  END ReadUtf;

  PROCEDURE Hex(c: CHAR): INTEGER;
    VAR v: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    v := 0;
    IF (c >= "0") & (c <= "9") THEN v := ORD(c) - ORD("0")
    ELSIF (c >= "a") & (c <= "f") THEN v := ORD(c) - ORD("a") + 10
    ELSIF (c >= "A") & (c <= "F") THEN v := ORD(c) - ORD("A") + 10
    END
    RETURN v
  END Hex;

  PROCEDURE Entity;   (* after & : &amp; &nbsp; &#351; &#x219; ... *)
    VAR e: ARRAY 12 OF CHAR; n, c, cp, i: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    n := 0; c := Next();
    WHILE (n < 10) & (IsAlnum(c) OR (c = ORD("#"))) DO e[n] := CHR(c); INC(n); c := Next() END;
    e[n] := 0X;
    IF (c = ORD(";")) & (n > 0) THEN
      cp := -1;
      IF e[0] = "#" THEN
        cp := 0;
        IF (e[1] = "x") OR (e[1] = "X") THEN i := 2; WHILE e[i] # 0X DO cp := cp * 16 + Hex(e[i]); INC(i) END
        ELSE i := 1; WHILE (e[i] >= "0") & (e[i] <= "9") DO cp := cp * 10 + ORD(e[i]) - ORD("0"); INC(i) END
        END
      ELSIF Same(e, "amp") THEN cp := 38 ELSIF Same(e, "lt") THEN cp := 60 ELSIF Same(e, "gt") THEN cp := 62
      ELSIF Same(e, "quot") THEN cp := 34 ELSIF Same(e, "apos") THEN cp := 39 ELSIF Same(e, "nbsp") THEN cp := 0A0H
      ELSIF Same(e, "mdash") THEN cp := 2014H ELSIF Same(e, "ndash") THEN cp := 2013H ELSIF Same(e, "hellip") THEN cp := 2026H
      ELSIF Same(e, "laquo") THEN cp := 0ABH ELSIF Same(e, "raquo") THEN cp := 0BBH
      ELSIF Same(e, "lsquo") OR Same(e, "rsquo") THEN cp := 2019H
      ELSIF Same(e, "ldquo") OR Same(e, "rdquo") OR Same(e, "bdquo") THEN cp := 201CH
      ELSIF Same(e, "middot") THEN cp := 0B7H ELSIF Same(e, "bull") THEN cp := 2022H ELSIF Same(e, "times") THEN cp := 0D7H
      END;
      IF cp >= 0 THEN PutCp(cp) END   (* an entity NORA does not know: nothing *)
    ELSE
      Emit("&"); i := 0; WHILE i < n DO Emit(e[i]); INC(i) END; pushed := c
    END
  END Entity;

  PROCEDURE SkipComment;   (* after <! : a comment to -->, or <!DOCTYPE ...> to > *)
    VAR c, dash: INTEGER; done: BOOLEAN;
  BEGIN
    c := Next(); done := FALSE;
    IF c = ORD("-") THEN
      c := Next(); dash := 0;
      WHILE ~done & (c >= 0) DO
        c := Next();
        IF c = ORD("-") THEN INC(dash) ELSIF (c = ORD(">")) & (dash >= 2) THEN done := TRUE ELSE dash := 0 END
      END
    ELSE
      WHILE (c >= 0) & (c # ORD(">")) DO c := Next() END
    END
  END SkipComment;

  PROCEDURE SkipRaw(VAR name: ARRAY OF CHAR);   (* script, style, textarea: everything up to </name *)
    VAR c, k: INTEGER; done: BOOLEAN;
  BEGIN
    done := FALSE; c := Next();
    WHILE ~done & (c >= 0) DO
      IF c = ORD("<") THEN
        c := Next();
        IF c = ORD("/") THEN
          k := 0; c := Next();
          WHILE (k < LEN(name)) & (name[k] # 0X) & (c >= 0) & (Low(CHR(c)) = name[k]) DO INC(k); c := Next() END;
          IF (k >= LEN(name)) OR (name[k] = 0X) THEN
            WHILE (c >= 0) & (c # ORD(">")) DO c := Next() END; done := TRUE
          END
        END
      ELSE c := Next()
      END
    END
  END SkipRaw;

  PROCEDURE ReadRaw(VAR name, v: ARRAY OF CHAR);   (* the text of a textarea, as it is, up to </name *)
    VAR c, k, n: INTEGER; done: BOOLEAN;
  BEGIN
    done := FALSE; n := 0; c := Next();
    WHILE ~done & (c >= 0) DO
      IF c = ORD("<") THEN
        c := Next();
        IF c = ORD("/") THEN
          k := 0; c := Next();
          WHILE (k < LEN(name)) & (name[k] # 0X) & (c >= 0) & (Low(CHR(c)) = name[k]) DO INC(k); c := Next() END;
          IF (k >= LEN(name)) OR (name[k] = 0X) THEN
            WHILE (c >= 0) & (c # ORD(">")) DO c := Next() END; done := TRUE
          END
        ELSIF n < LEN(v) - 1 THEN v[n] := "<"; INC(n)
        END
      ELSE
        IF (c # 13) & (n < LEN(v) - 1) THEN IF c < 32 THEN v[n] := " " ELSE v[n] := CHR(c) END; INC(n) END;
        c := Next()
      END
    END;
    WHILE (n > 0) & (v[n - 1] = " ") DO DEC(n) END;
    v[n] := 0X;
    k := 0; WHILE v[k] = " " DO INC(k) END;
    IF k > 0 THEN Cut(v, 0, k) END
  END ReadRaw;

  PROCEDURE ReadTag(c: INTEGER);   (* after <, c is its first letter: the tag into tb, its name into tname *)
    VAR n, q, prev, i, j: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    n := 0; q := 0; prev := 0;
    WHILE (c >= 0) & ~((c = ORD(">")) & (q = 0)) DO
      IF q # 0 THEN IF c = q THEN q := 0 END
      ELSIF ((c = 22H) OR (c = 27H)) & (prev = ORD("=")) THEN q := c
      END;
      IF (q = 0) & (c > 32) THEN prev := c END;
      IF n < LEN(tb) - 1 THEN tb[n] := CHR(c MOD 256); INC(n) END;
      c := Next()
    END;
    tb[n] := 0X;
    i := 0; closing := tb[0] = "/"; IF closing THEN i := 1 END;
    j := 0;
    WHILE IsAlnum(ORD(tb[i])) & (j < LEN(tname) - 1) DO tname[j] := Low(tb[i]); INC(i); INC(j) END;
    tname[j] := 0X; tpos := i; IF tpos < 1 THEN tpos := 1 END;
    selfc := (n > 0) & (tb[n - 1] = "/")
  END ReadTag;

  PROCEDURE Attr(nm: ARRAY OF CHAR; VAR v: ARRAY OF CHAR);   (* the value of attribute nm of the tag in tb; "" *)
    VAR i, k, j: INTEGER; q: CHAR; found: BOOLEAN;
  BEGIN
    i := tpos; found := FALSE; v[0] := 0X;
    WHILE ~found & (i < LEN(tb)) & (tb[i] # 0X) DO
      IF (tb[i] = 22X) OR (tb[i] = 27X) THEN   (* a value in quotes: jump over it *)
        q := tb[i]; INC(i); WHILE (tb[i] # 0X) & (tb[i] # q) DO INC(i) END; IF tb[i] # 0X THEN INC(i) END
      ELSIF tb[i - 1] <= " " THEN
        k := 0; WHILE (nm[k] # 0X) & (Low(tb[i + k]) = nm[k]) DO INC(k) END;
        IF nm[k] = 0X THEN
          j := i + k; WHILE tb[j] = " " DO INC(j) END;
          IF tb[j] = "=" THEN found := TRUE; i := j + 1 ELSE INC(i) END
        ELSE INC(i)
        END
      ELSE INC(i)
      END
    END;
    IF found THEN
      WHILE tb[i] = " " DO INC(i) END;
      q := " "; IF (tb[i] = 22X) OR (tb[i] = 27X) THEN q := tb[i]; INC(i) END;
      j := 0;
      WHILE (tb[i] # 0X) & (tb[i] # q) & ~((q = " ") & (tb[i] = "/") & (tb[i + 1] = 0X)) & (j < LEN(v) - 1) DO
        IF (tb[i] = "&") & (tb[i + 1] = "a") & (tb[i + 2] = "m") & (tb[i + 3] = "p") & (tb[i + 4] = ";") THEN
          v[j] := "&"; i := i + 5
        ELSE v[j] := tb[i]; INC(i)
        END;
        INC(j)
      END;
      v[j] := 0X
    END
  END Attr;

  PROCEDURE HasAttr(nm: ARRAY OF CHAR): BOOLEAN;   (* the tag in tb has attribute nm (checked, selected, value=...) *)
    VAR i, k: INTEGER; q: CHAR; found: BOOLEAN;
  BEGIN
    i := tpos; found := FALSE;
    WHILE ~found & (i < LEN(tb)) & (tb[i] # 0X) DO
      IF (tb[i] = 22X) OR (tb[i] = 27X) THEN
        q := tb[i]; INC(i); WHILE (tb[i] # 0X) & (tb[i] # q) DO INC(i) END; IF tb[i] # 0X THEN INC(i) END
      ELSIF tb[i - 1] <= " " THEN
        k := 0; WHILE (nm[k] # 0X) & (Low(tb[i + k]) = nm[k]) DO INC(k) END;
        IF (nm[k] = 0X) & ((tb[i + k] <= " ") OR (tb[i + k] = "=") OR (tb[i + k] = "/")) THEN found := TRUE ELSE INC(i) END
      ELSE INC(i)
      END
    END
    RETURN found
  END HasAttr;

  PROCEDURE ShowVal(VAR v, out: ARRAY OF CHAR);   (* a value as the page gave it (UTF-8) -> NoraChick's letters *)
    VAR i, j, b, n, cp: INTEGER; c: CHAR;
  BEGIN
    i := 0; j := 0;
    WHILE (i < LEN(v)) & (v[i] # 0X) & (j < LEN(out) - 1) DO
      b := ORD(v[i]) MOD 256; INC(i);
      IF b < 80H THEN cp := b
      ELSE
        IF b >= 0F0H THEN n := 3; cp := b MOD 8 ELSIF b >= 0E0H THEN n := 2; cp := b MOD 16
        ELSIF b >= 0C0H THEN n := 1; cp := b MOD 32 ELSE n := 0; cp := -1
        END;
        WHILE (n > 0) & (i < LEN(v)) & (ORD(v[i]) MOD 256 >= 80H) & (ORD(v[i]) MOD 256 < 0C0H) DO
          cp := cp * 64 + ORD(v[i]) MOD 256 - 80H; INC(i); DEC(n)
        END;
        IF n > 0 THEN cp := -1 END
      END;
      IF cp >= 0 THEN c := Map(cp); IF c # 0X THEN out[j] := c; INC(j) END END
    END;
    out[j] := 0X
  END ShowVal;

  PROCEDURE ToUtf(VAR s, d: ARRAY OF CHAR);   (* NoraChick's letters -> UTF-8 (the Romanian ones are 128..137) *)
    VAR i, j, cp: INTEGER; c: CHAR;
  BEGIN
    i := 0; j := 0;
    WHILE (i < LEN(s)) & (s[i] # 0X) & (j < LEN(d) - 2) DO
      c := s[i]; INC(i);
      IF ORD(c) < 128 THEN d[j] := c; INC(j)
      ELSE
        cp := ORD(c);
        IF cp = 128 THEN cp := 103H ELSIF cp = 129 THEN cp := 0E2H ELSIF cp = 130 THEN cp := 0EEH
        ELSIF cp = 131 THEN cp := 219H ELSIF cp = 132 THEN cp := 21BH ELSIF cp = 133 THEN cp := 102H
        ELSIF cp = 134 THEN cp := 0C2H ELSIF cp = 135 THEN cp := 0CEH ELSIF cp = 136 THEN cp := 218H
        ELSIF cp = 137 THEN cp := 21AH ELSE cp := 3FH
        END;
        IF cp < 80H THEN d[j] := CHR(cp); INC(j)
        ELSE d[j] := CHR(0C0H + cp DIV 64); d[j + 1] := CHR(80H + cp MOD 64); j := j + 2
        END
      END
    END;
    d[j] := 0X
  END ToUtf;

  (* ---------- addresses ---------- *)

  PROCEDURE Origin(VAR s: ARRAY OF CHAR): INTEGER;   (* where the path starts: after scheme://host *)
    VAR i: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    i := Find(s, "://", 0);
    IF i < 0 THEN i := 0 ELSE i := i + 3 END;
    WHILE (i < LEN(s)) & (s[i] # 0X) & (s[i] # "/") & (s[i] # "?") & (s[i] # "#") DO INC(i) END
    RETURN i
  END Origin;

  PROCEDURE Dots(VAR s: ARRAY OF CHAR);   (* /./ and /x/../ out of the path *)
    VAR o, p, q: INTEGER; again: BOOLEAN;
  BEGIN
    o := Origin(s); again := TRUE;
    WHILE again DO
      again := FALSE;
      p := Find(s, "/./", o);
      IF p >= 0 THEN Cut(s, p, 2); again := TRUE
      ELSE
        p := Find(s, "/../", o);
        IF p >= 0 THEN
          q := p - 1; WHILE (q > o) & (s[q] # "/") DO DEC(q) END;
          IF (q >= o) & (s[q] = "/") THEN Cut(s, q, p + 3 - q) ELSE Cut(s, p, 3) END;
          again := TRUE
        END
      END
    END
  END Dots;

  PROCEDURE Resolve(VAR h: ARRAY OF CHAR; VAR out: ARRAY OF CHAR);   (* a link of the page -> a whole address; "" = none *)
    VAR t: ARRAY LL OF CHAR; i, o, k: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    i := 0; WHILE (h[i] = " ") OR (h[i] = 9X) OR (h[i] = 0AX) DO INC(i) END;
    k := 0; WHILE (i < LEN(h)) & (h[i] # 0X) & (k < LL - 1) DO t[k] := h[i]; INC(i); INC(k) END; t[k] := 0X;
    out[0] := 0X;
    IF (t[0] = 0X) OR (t[0] = "#") OR Starts(t, "javascript:") OR Starts(t, "mailto:") OR Starts(t, "tel:") OR Starts(t, "data:") THEN
      (* nothing to open *)
    ELSIF Starts(t, "nora:") THEN Copy(t, out)   (* Nora's own pages (the films of Filme1) *)
    ELSIF (Find(t, "://", 0) > 0) & (Find(t, "://", 0) < 10) THEN Copy(t, out)
    ELSIF (t[0] = "/") & (t[1] = "/") THEN
      i := Find(base, "://", 0); IF i < 0 THEN Copy("https:", out) ELSE Copy(base, out); out[i + 1] := 0X END;
      Add(out, t)
    ELSE
      Copy(base, out); o := Origin(out);
      IF t[0] = "/" THEN out[o] := 0X
      ELSIF t[0] = "?" THEN
        i := o; WHILE (out[i] # 0X) & (out[i] # "?") & (out[i] # "#") DO INC(i) END; out[i] := 0X
      ELSE
        i := o; WHILE (out[i] # 0X) & (out[i] # "?") & (out[i] # "#") DO INC(i) END; out[i] := 0X;
        k := Len(out) - 1; WHILE (k >= o) & (out[k] # "/") DO DEC(k) END;
        IF k >= o THEN out[k + 1] := 0X ELSE out[o] := 0X; AddC(out, "/") END
      END;
      Add(out, t); Dots(out)
    END;
    i := Find(out, "#", 0); IF i > 0 THEN out[i] := 0X END;
    i := Find(out, "uddg=", 0);   (* a result of DuckDuckGo: go straight to the page it points to *)
    IF i > 0 THEN
      i := i + 5; k := 0;
      WHILE (out[i] # 0X) & (out[i] # "&") & (k < LL - 1) DO
        IF (out[i] = "%") & (out[i + 1] # 0X) & (out[i + 2] # 0X) THEN t[k] := CHR(Hex(out[i + 1]) * 16 + Hex(out[i + 2])); i := i + 3
        ELSE t[k] := out[i]; INC(i)
        END;
        INC(k)
      END;
      t[k] := 0X; IF Find(t, "://", 0) > 0 THEN Copy(t, out) END
    END
  END Resolve;

  PROCEDURE NewLink(u: ARRAY OF CHAR): INTEGER;
    VAR r: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    r := -1; IF (u[0] # 0X) & (nl < NL) THEN Copy(u, links[nl]); r := nl; INC(nl) END
    RETURN r
  END NewLink;

  (* ---------- the forms ---------- *)

  PROCEDURE NewField(kind: INTEGER): INTEGER;   (* a field of the form being read, its name and value from the tag; -1 *)
    VAR f: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    f := -1;
    IF (curForm >= 0) & (nf < NF) THEN
      f := nf; INC(nf);
      fForm[f] := curForm; fKind[f] := kind; fW[f] := -1; fOpt0[f] := no; fNOpt[f] := 0; fSel[f] := 0;
      fOn[f] := HasAttr("checked"); fLabel[f][0] := 0X;
      Attr("name", fName[f]); Attr("value", fVal[f])
    END
    RETURN f
  END NewField;

  PROCEDURE EndOption;   (* a choice of a list without value= sends its text *)
    VAR t: ARRAY 80 OF CHAR;
  BEGIN
    IF inOption >= 0 THEN
      IF ~optHasVal THEN ToUtf(oText[inOption], t); Copy(t, oVal[inOption]) END;
      inOption := -1
    END
  END EndOption;

  PROCEDURE EndSelect;   (* the list is read: its word is as wide as its longest choice *)
    VAR f, i, w: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    EndOption; f := inSelect; inSelect := -1;
    IF (f >= 0) & (fW[f] >= 0) THEN
      w := 4; FOR i := fOpt0[f] TO fOpt0[f] + fNOpt[f] - 1 DO IF Len(oText[i]) + 3 > w THEN w := Len(oText[i]) + 3 END END;
      IF w > 30 THEN w := 30 END;
      wL[fW[f]] := w
    END
  END EndSelect;

  PROCEDURE EndButton;
    VAR f, w: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    f := inButton; inButton := -1;
    IF f >= 0 THEN
      IF fLabel[f][0] = 0X THEN fLabel[f] := "Send" END;
      w := Len(fLabel[f]); IF (w > 0) & (fLabel[f][w - 1] = " ") THEN fLabel[f][w - 1] := 0X; DEC(w) END;
      IF w > 28 THEN fLabel[f][28] := 0X; w := 28 END;
      IF fW[f] >= 0 THEN wL[fW[f]] := w + 2 END
    END
  END EndButton;

  PROCEDURE FormTag;   (* <form ...>: where it goes and how *)
    VAR v, res: ARRAY LL OF CHAR; i: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    curForm := -1;
    IF nfo < NFO THEN
      Attr("action", v); Resolve(v, res);
      IF res[0] = 0X THEN Copy(base, res); i := Find(res, "#", 0); IF i > 0 THEN res[i] := 0X END END;
      Copy(res, frAct[nfo]); Attr("method", v); frPost[nfo] := Starts(v, "post");
      curForm := nfo; INC(nfo)
    END;
    Break(kPara)
  END FormTag;

  PROCEDURE InputTag;   (* <input ...> inside a form *)
    VAR t, s: ARRAY 64 OF CHAR; v: ARRAY LL OF CHAR; f: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    Attr("type", t);
    IF Starts(t, "hidden") THEN f := NewField(fkHidden)
    ELSIF Starts(t, "checkbox") THEN f := NewField(fkCheck); IF f >= 0 THEN FieldWord(f, 3) END
    ELSIF Starts(t, "radio") THEN f := NewField(fkRadio); IF f >= 0 THEN FieldWord(f, 3) END
    ELSIF Starts(t, "submit") OR Starts(t, "image") THEN
      f := NewField(fkSubmit);
      IF f >= 0 THEN
        IF Starts(t, "image") THEN Attr("alt", v) ELSE Copy(fVal[f], v) END;
        ShowVal(v, s); Copy(s, fLabel[f]); inButton := f; FieldWord(f, 2); EndButton
      END
    ELSIF Starts(t, "button") OR Starts(t, "reset") OR Starts(t, "file") THEN   (* JavaScript or files: nothing *)
    ELSE
      IF Starts(t, "password") THEN f := NewField(fkPass) ELSE f := NewField(fkText) END;
      IF f >= 0 THEN Attr("placeholder", v); ShowVal(v, s); Copy(s, fLabel[f]); FieldWord(f, 16) END
    END
  END InputTag;

  PROCEDURE AttrNum(nm: ARRAY OF CHAR): INTEGER;   (* width="300" -> 300; 0 *)
    VAR v: ARRAY 32 OF CHAR; i, n: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    Attr(nm, v); i := 0; n := 0;
    WHILE (v[i] >= "0") & (v[i] <= "9") & (n < 100000) DO n := n * 10 + ORD(v[i]) - ORD("0"); INC(i) END
    RETURN n
  END AttrNum;

  PROCEDURE SlotFor(VAR u: ARRAY OF CHAR; aw, ah: INTEGER): INTEGER;   (* the picture of address u; a new one if needed; -1 *)
    VAR i, best: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    i := 0; WHILE (i < NI) & ~((iSt[i] # 0) & Same(iUrl[i], u)) DO INC(i) END;
    IF i < NI THEN
      best := i; iUse[i] := pageGen;
      IF (aw > 0) & (ah > 0) THEN iAw[i] := aw; iAh[i] := ah END
    ELSE   (* a free one, or the one not seen for the longest time (not the one being asked for) *)
      best := -1;
      FOR i := 0 TO NI - 1 DO
        IF (iSt[i] # 2) & (iUse[i] # pageGen) & ((best < 0) OR (iUse[i] < iUse[best])) THEN best := i END
      END;
      IF best >= 0 THEN
        Copy(u, iUrl[best]); iSt[best] := 1; iUse[best] := pageGen; iAw[best] := aw; iAh[best] := ah;
        iAlt[best][0] := 0X; iWhy[best][0] := 0X
      END
    END
    RETURN best
  END SlotFor;

  PROCEDURE ImgTag;   (* <img>: a picture word, or its alt text as before *)
    VAR v, res, alt: ARRAY LL OF CHAR; aw, ah, s, i: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    Attr("src", v); IF (v[0] = 0X) OR Starts(v, "data:") THEN Attr("data-src", v) END;
    Resolve(v, res); aw := AttrNum("width"); ah := AttrNum("height"); Attr("alt", alt);
    s := -1;
    IF (res[0] # 0X) & (inButton < 0) & (inSelect < 0) & ~((aw > 0) & (aw < 24) & (ah > 0) & (ah < 24))
        & (Find(res, ".svg", 0) < 0) THEN
      s := SlotFor(res, aw, ah)
    END;
    IF s >= 0 THEN
      IF alt[0] # 0X THEN ShowVal(alt, iAlt[s]) END;
      EndWord;
      IF nw < NW THEN wS[nw] := s; wL[nw] := 0; wK[nw] := kImg; wA[nw] := inA; wF[nw] := -1; INC(nw) END
    ELSIF (alt[0] # 0X) & (Len(alt) <= 60) THEN
      Emit("("); i := 0; WHILE alt[i] # 0X DO IF ORD(alt[i]) < 128 THEN Emit(alt[i]) END; INC(i) END; Emit(")"); Emit(" ")
    END
  END ImgTag;

  PROCEDURE MetaTag;   (* <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="4; url=..."> *)
    VAR v, u, res: ARRAY LL OF CHAR; i, d, k, j: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    Attr("http-equiv", v);
    IF Starts(v, "refresh") THEN
      Attr("content", v); i := 0; WHILE v[i] = " " DO INC(i) END;
      d := 0; WHILE (v[i] >= "0") & (v[i] <= "9") & (d < 1000) DO d := d * 10 + ORD(v[i]) - ORD("0"); INC(i) END;
      k := i;
      WHILE (v[k] # 0X) & ~((Low(v[k]) = "u") & (Low(v[k + 1]) = "r") & (Low(v[k + 2]) = "l") & (v[k + 3] = "=")) DO INC(k) END;
      IF v[k] # 0X THEN
        k := k + 4; WHILE (v[k] = " ") OR (v[k] = 22X) OR (v[k] = 27X) DO INC(k) END;
        j := 0; WHILE (v[k] # 0X) & (v[k] # 22X) & (v[k] # 27X) & (j < LL - 1) DO u[j] := v[k]; INC(j); INC(k) END; u[j] := 0X;
        Resolve(u, res)
      ELSE Copy(base, res)
      END;
      IF (d <= 30) & (res[0] # 0X) THEN
        Copy(res, refreshUrl); refreshAt := Ceas.Ms() + d * 1000; IF refreshAt = 0 THEN refreshAt := 1 END
      END
    END
  END MetaTag;

  PROCEDURE Ends(VAR s: ARRAY OF CHAR; e: ARRAY OF CHAR): BOOLEAN;   (* s (without ? or #) ends with e, small or capital *)
    VAR n, k, i: INTEGER; ok: BOOLEAN;
  BEGIN
    n := 0; WHILE (n < LEN(s)) & (s[n] # 0X) & (s[n] # "?") & (s[n] # "#") DO INC(n) END;
    k := 0; WHILE (k < LEN(e)) & (e[k] # 0X) DO INC(k) END;
    ok := n >= k; i := 0;
    WHILE ok & (i < k) DO IF Low(s[n - k + i]) # e[i] THEN ok := FALSE END; INC(i) END
    RETURN ok
  END Ends;

  PROCEDURE IsMedia(VAR u: ARRAY OF CHAR): BOOLEAN;   (* a film or a sound Android can play *)
  BEGIN
    RETURN Ends(u, ".mp4") OR Ends(u, ".webm") OR Ends(u, ".m4v") OR Ends(u, ".mp3") OR Ends(u, ".m4a")
      OR Ends(u, ".ogg") OR Ends(u, ".oga") OR Ends(u, ".opus") OR Ends(u, ".wav")
  END IsMedia;

  PROCEDURE IsAudio(VAR u: ARRAY OF CHAR): BOOLEAN;
  BEGIN
    RETURN Ends(u, ".mp3") OR Ends(u, ".m4a") OR Ends(u, ".ogg") OR Ends(u, ".oga") OR Ends(u, ".opus") OR Ends(u, ".wav")
  END IsAudio;

  PROCEDURE IsFile(VAR u: ARRAY OF CHAR): BOOLEAN;   (* a file to keep, not a page to read *)
  BEGIN
    RETURN Ends(u, ".pdf") OR Ends(u, ".zip") OR Ends(u, ".apk") OR Ends(u, ".epub") OR Ends(u, ".gz") OR Ends(u, ".tgz")
      OR Ends(u, ".tar") OR Ends(u, ".7z") OR Ends(u, ".rar") OR Ends(u, ".doc") OR Ends(u, ".docx") OR Ends(u, ".xls")
      OR Ends(u, ".xlsx") OR Ends(u, ".ppt") OR Ends(u, ".pptx") OR Ends(u, ".odt") OR Ends(u, ".ods") OR Ends(u, ".odp")
      OR Ends(u, ".mod") OR Ends(u, ".deb") OR Ends(u, ".iso") OR Ends(u, ".jar") OR Ends(u, ".bin") OR Ends(u, ".dex")
      OR Ends(u, ".ttf") OR Ends(u, ".otf") OR Ends(u, ".csv") OR Ends(u, ".mobi") OR Ends(u, ".djvu")
  END IsFile;

  PROCEDURE MediaCand(VAR src, typ: ARRAY OF CHAR);   (* a source of the film being read: keep the best one *)
    VAR res: ARRAY LL OF CHAR; ok: BOOLEAN;
  BEGIN
    Resolve(src, res);
    IF res[0] # 0X THEN
      IF typ[0] # 0X THEN
        ok := (Find(typ, "mp4", 0) >= 0) OR (Find(typ, "webm", 0) >= 0) OR (Find(typ, "mpeg", 0) >= 0)
          OR (medAud & ((Find(typ, "ogg", 0) >= 0) OR (Find(typ, "opus", 0) >= 0) OR (Find(typ, "wav", 0) >= 0)))
      ELSE ok := IsMedia(res) & ~(~medAud & Ends(res, ".ogg"))
      END;
      IF ok & ((medUrl[0] = 0X)
          OR (((Find(res, "480p", 0) >= 0) OR (Find(res, "360p", 0) >= 0))
            & (Find(medUrl, "480p", 0) < 0) & (Find(medUrl, "360p", 0) < 0))) THEN
        Copy(res, medUrl)   (* the first that plays; a 480p or 360p one is better on a phone *)
      END
    END
  END MediaCand;

  PROCEDURE StartMedia;   (* <video> or <audio> *)
    VAR v, t: ARRAY LL OF CHAR;
  BEGIN
    inMedia := TRUE; medAud := Same(tname, "audio"); medUrl[0] := 0X; medPoster[0] := 0X;
    Attr("src", v); t[0] := 0X; IF v[0] # 0X THEN MediaCand(v, t) END;
    Attr("poster", v); IF v[0] # 0X THEN Resolve(v, medPoster) END
  END StartMedia;

  PROCEDURE EndMedia;   (* </video>: the film becomes a word of the page *)
    VAR k: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    IF inMedia THEN
      inMedia := FALSE;
      IF (medUrl[0] # 0X) & (nmd < NV) THEN
        k := nmd; INC(nmd); Copy(medUrl, mdUrl[k]); mdAud[k] := medAud; mdPost[k] := -1;
        IF ~medAud & (medPoster[0] # 0X) & (Find(medPoster, ".svg", 0) < 0) THEN mdPost[k] := SlotFor(medPoster, 0, 0) END;
        EndWord;
        IF nw < NW THEN wS[nw] := k; wL[nw] := 0; wK[nw] := kVid; wA[nw] := inA; wF[nw] := -1; INC(nw) END
      END
    END
  END EndMedia;

  (* ---------- what each tag means ---------- *)

  PROCEDURE Tag;
    VAR v, res: ARRAY LL OF CHAR; i, f: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    IF skipDepth > 0 THEN   (* inside nav, footer, ...: only the same tag matters *)
      IF Same(tname, skipName) THEN IF closing THEN DEC(skipDepth) ELSIF ~selfc THEN INC(skipDepth) END END
    ELSIF ~closing & Same(tname, "textarea") & (curForm >= 0) & ~selfc THEN
      f := NewField(fkArea); IF f >= 0 THEN Attr("placeholder", v); ShowVal(v, fLabel[f]); ReadRaw(tname, fVal[f]); FieldWord(f, 16) END
    ELSIF ~closing & (Same(tname, "script") OR Same(tname, "style") OR Same(tname, "textarea")) THEN
      IF ~selfc THEN SkipRaw(tname) END
    ELSIF Same(tname, "form") THEN
      IF closing THEN EndSelect; EndButton; curForm := -1; Break(kPara) ELSE FormTag END
    ELSIF Same(tname, "input") & ~closing THEN IF curForm >= 0 THEN InputTag END
    ELSIF Same(tname, "select") & (curForm >= 0) THEN
      IF closing THEN EndSelect
      ELSIF ~selfc THEN EndSelect; f := NewField(fkSelect); IF f >= 0 THEN FieldWord(f, 4); inSelect := f END
      END
    ELSIF Same(tname, "option") & (inSelect >= 0) THEN
      EndOption;
      IF ~closing & (no < NO) THEN
        inOption := no; INC(no); INC(fNOpt[inSelect]); oText[inOption][0] := 0X;
        optHasVal := HasAttr("value"); Attr("value", oVal[inOption]);
        IF HasAttr("selected") THEN fSel[inSelect] := inOption - fOpt0[inSelect] END
      END
    ELSIF Same(tname, "video") OR Same(tname, "audio") THEN
      IF closing THEN EndMedia ELSIF ~selfc THEN EndMedia; StartMedia ELSE StartMedia; EndMedia END
    ELSIF Same(tname, "source") & inMedia & ~closing THEN
      Attr("src", v); Attr("type", res); MediaCand(v, res)
    ELSIF inMedia THEN   (* <track>, the text for old browsers: nothing *)
    ELSIF Same(tname, "button") & (curForm >= 0) & ~selfc THEN
      Attr("type", v);
      IF closing THEN EndButton
      ELSIF (v[0] = 0X) OR Starts(v, "submit") THEN
        EndButton; f := NewField(fkSubmit); IF f >= 0 THEN FieldWord(f, 6); inButton := f END
      ELSE Copy(tname, skipName); skipDepth := 1   (* a button for JavaScript *)
      END
    ELSIF ~closing & ~selfc & (Same(tname, "nav") OR Same(tname, "footer") OR Same(tname, "aside")
        OR Same(tname, "button") OR Same(tname, "svg") OR Same(tname, "iframe") OR Same(tname, "select")
        OR Same(tname, "template") OR Same(tname, "object") OR Same(tname, "canvas")) THEN
      Copy(tname, skipName); skipDepth := 1
    ELSIF Same(tname, "title") THEN inTitle := ~closing & ~selfc
    ELSIF Same(tname, "a") THEN
      EndWord; inA := -1;
      IF ~closing THEN Attr("href", v); Resolve(v, res); inA := NewLink(res) END
    ELSIF Same(tname, "br") THEN Break(kLine)
    ELSIF Same(tname, "h1") OR Same(tname, "h2") THEN Break(kPara); IF closing THEN head := 0 ELSE head := 1 END
    ELSIF Same(tname, "h3") OR Same(tname, "h4") OR Same(tname, "h5") OR Same(tname, "h6") THEN
      Break(kPara); IF closing THEN head := 0 ELSE head := 2 END
    ELSIF Same(tname, "li") THEN IF ~closing THEN Break(kLine); Emit("-"); Emit(" ") END
    ELSIF Same(tname, "p") OR Same(tname, "ul") OR Same(tname, "ol") OR Same(tname, "dl") OR Same(tname, "table")
        OR Same(tname, "blockquote") OR Same(tname, "hr") OR Same(tname, "section") OR Same(tname, "article")
        OR Same(tname, "main") OR Same(tname, "center") OR Same(tname, "address") OR Same(tname, "details") THEN
      Break(kPara)
    ELSIF Same(tname, "pre") THEN Break(kPara); inPre := ~closing
    ELSIF Same(tname, "div") OR Same(tname, "tr") OR Same(tname, "dt") OR Same(tname, "dd") OR Same(tname, "header")
        OR Same(tname, "caption") OR Same(tname, "figcaption") OR Same(tname, "summary") OR Same(tname, "figure")
        OR Same(tname, "fieldset") OR Same(tname, "legend") THEN
      Break(kLine)
    ELSIF Same(tname, "td") OR Same(tname, "th") THEN Emit(" ")
    ELSIF Same(tname, "img") & ~closing THEN ImgTag
    ELSIF Same(tname, "meta") & ~closing THEN MetaTag
    ELSIF Same(tname, "base") & ~closing THEN
      Attr("href", v); IF v[0] # 0X THEN Resolve(v, res); IF res[0] # 0X THEN Copy(res, base) END END
    END
  END Tag;

  PROCEDURE Parse(from, keep: ARRAY OF CHAR);   (* the page in file from -> the words; keep = "" or where to copy it *)
    VAR c, d: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    Reset;
    fh := Fisier.Deschide(from); teeH := -1;
    IF (fh >= 0) & (keep[0] # 0X) THEN teeH := Fisier.Creeaza(keep) END;
    IF fh >= 0 THEN
      c := Next();
      WHILE c >= 0 DO
        IF c = ORD("<") THEN
          d := Next();
          IF (d = ORD("!")) OR (d = ORD("?")) THEN SkipComment
          ELSIF (d = ORD("/")) OR IsLetter(d) THEN ReadTag(d); Tag
          ELSE IF skipDepth = 0 THEN Emit("<") END; pushed := d
          END
        ELSIF skipDepth > 0 THEN   (* text that goes away *)
        ELSIF c = ORD("&") THEN Entity
        ELSE ReadUtf(c)
        END;
        c := Next()
      END;
      Fisier.Gata(fh); EndSelect; EndButton; EndMedia; EndWord;
      IF teeH >= 0 THEN Fisier.Gata(teeH); teeH := -1 END
    END
  END Parse;

  (* ---------- rows ---------- *)

  (* ---------- NoraChick's letters ---------- *)

  PROCEDURE F(k, a, b: INTEGER);
  BEGIN fA[k] := a; fB[k] := b
  END F;

  PROCEDURE Font;   (* made from OllGL6's letters, plus the small and the Romanian ones *)
    VAR k: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    FOR k := 0 TO 255 DO fA[k] := 0; fB[k] := 0 END;
    F(33, 135300, 4198400); F(34, 337920, 0); F(35, 11242, 32833536); F(36, 147086, 6230016); F(37, 812100, 9014272); F(38, 412296, 22623232);
    F(39, 135424, 0); F(40, 69896, 8521728); F(41, 266306, 2236416); F(42, 4782, 22151168); F(43, 4255, 4325376); F(44, 0, 12722176);
    F(45, 31, 0); F(46, 0, 405504); F(47, 1092, 8912896); F(48, 476789, 26785792); F(49, 143492, 4339712); F(50, 476194, 4488192);
    F(51, 1017986, 1619968); F(52, 72018, 32573440); F(53, 1033153, 1619968); F(54, 205342, 18397184); F(55, 1016900, 8658944); F(56, 476718, 18397184);
    F(57, 476719, 1126400); F(58, 12672, 12976128); F(59, 132, 135424); F(60, 69904, 8521728); F(61, 992, 32505856); F(62, 266305, 2236416);
    F(63, 476194, 4198400); F(64, 476917, 24655872); F(65, 476735, 18400256); F(66, 1001022, 18413568); F(67, 476688, 17348608); F(68, 936497, 18444288);
    F(69, 1032734, 17333248); F(70, 1032734, 17317888); F(71, 476695, 18398208); F(72, 575039, 18400256); F(73, 462980, 4339712); F(74, 231490, 2699264);
    F(75, 576152, 21578752); F(76, 541200, 17333248); F(77, 585397, 18400256); F(78, 575285, 20497408); F(79, 476721, 18397184); F(80, 1001022, 17317888);
    F(81, 476721, 22623232); F(82, 1001022, 21578752); F(83, 508430, 1112064); F(84, 1020036, 4329472); F(85, 575025, 18397184); F(86, 575025, 18157568);
    F(87, 575029, 22718464); F(88, 574788, 11060224); F(89, 574788, 4329472); F(90, 1016900, 8944640); F(91, 467208, 8665088); F(92, 540932, 2130944);
    F(93, 460866, 2177024); F(94, 141856, 0); F(95, 0, 992); F(96, 266240, 0); F(97, 449, 16301056); F(98, 541401, 18413568);
    F(99, 464, 17348608); F(100, 34227, 18398208); F(101, 465, 33044480); F(102, 206108, 8658944); F(103, 497, 18398254); F(104, 541401, 18400256);
    F(105, 131460, 4339712); F(106, 65730, 2165324); F(107, 541268, 25839616); F(108, 397444, 4339712); F(109, 853, 22594560); F(110, 729, 18400256);
    F(111, 465, 18397184); F(112, 977, 18414096); F(113, 497, 18398241); F(114, 729, 17317888); F(115, 496, 14743552); F(116, 271240, 8689664);
    F(117, 561, 18461696); F(118, 561, 18157568); F(119, 561, 22718464); F(120, 554, 4539392); F(121, 561, 18398254); F(122, 994, 4488192);
    F(123, 205072, 8656896); F(124, 135300, 4329472); F(125, 395329, 2174976); F(126, 9, 23068672); F(128, 571841, 16301056); F(129, 141761, 16301056);
    F(130, 141700, 4339712); F(131, 496, 14743688); F(132, 271240, 8689800); F(133, 585582143, 18400256); F(134, 145180223, 18400256); F(135, 145166468, 4339712);
    F(136, 508430, 1112200); F(137, 1020036, 4329608)
  END Font;

  PROCEDURE Row(k, r: INTEGER): INTEGER;   (* row r (0..10 = -2..8) of letter k, 5 bits, the left one = 16 *)
    VAR v, i: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    IF r < 6 THEN v := fA[k]; FOR i := r TO 4 DO v := v DIV 32 END
    ELSE v := fB[k]; FOR i := r TO 9 DO v := v DIV 32 END
    END
    RETURN v MOD 32
  END Row;

  PROCEDURE Letter(x, y, k, m, c: INTEGER; px: BOOLEAN);   (* y = the top of a capital *)
    VAR r, b, i0, v: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    IF (fA[k] # 0) OR (fB[k] # 0) THEN
      FOR r := 0 TO 10 DO
        v := Row(k, r); b := 0;
        WHILE b < 5 DO
          IF ODD(v DIV LSL(1, 4 - b)) THEN
            i0 := b; WHILE (b < 5) & ODD(v DIV LSL(1, 4 - b)) DO INC(b) END;
            IF px THEN Grafica.Dreptunghi(x + i0 * m, y + (r - 2) * m, (b - i0) * m, m, c)
            ELSE OllGL6.Dreptunghi2D(x + i0 * m, y + (r - 2) * m, (b - i0) * m, m, c)
            END
          ELSE INC(b)
          END
        END
      END
    END
  END Letter;

  PROCEDURE Say2(x, y: INTEGER; s: ARRAY OF CHAR; m, c: INTEGER);   (* a text with NoraChick's letters (triangles) *)
    VAR i: INTEGER;
  BEGIN i := 0; WHILE (i < LEN(s)) & (s[i] # 0X) DO Letter(x + i * 6 * m, y, ORD(s[i]) MOD 256, m, c, FALSE); INC(i) END
  END Say2;

  PROCEDURE SayPx(x, y: INTEGER; s: ARRAY OF CHAR; m, c: INTEGER);   (* the same in pixels (the keyboard screen) *)
    VAR i: INTEGER;
  BEGIN i := 0; WHILE (i < LEN(s)) & (s[i] # 0X) DO Letter(x + i * 6 * m, y, ORD(s[i]) MOD 256, m, c, TRUE); INC(i) END
  END SayPx;

  PROCEDURE RowH(m: INTEGER): INTEGER;   (* the height of a row of text of size m: accents, letter, descender, a gap *)
  BEGIN RETURN 11 * m + 4
  END RowH;

  PROCEDURE SaveSize;
    VAR h: INTEGER;
  BEGIN h := Fisier.Creeaza("nora.cfg"); IF h >= 0 THEN Fisier.Scrie(h, 78); Fisier.Scrie(h, ts); Fisier.Gata(h) END
  END SaveSize;

  PROCEDURE LoadSize;
    VAR h: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    h := Fisier.Deschide("nora.cfg");
    IF h >= 0 THEN IF Fisier.Citeste(h) = 78 THEN ts := Fisier.Citeste(h) END; Fisier.Gata(h) END;
    IF (ts < 2) OR (ts > 4) THEN ts := 2 END
  END LoadSize;

  PROCEDURE Glue(c: CHAR): BOOLEAN;
  BEGIN RETURN (c = ",") OR (c = ".") OR (c = ":") OR (c = ")") OR (c = "!") OR (c = "?")
  END Glue;

  PROCEDURE ImgSize(s: INTEGER; VAR dw, dh: INTEGER);   (* how big picture s is on the page; 0 x 0 = left out *)
    VAR w0, h0, mw: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    mw := W - 2 * MX;
    IF iSt[s] = 3 THEN w0 := iW[s]; h0 := iH[s] ELSE w0 := iAw[s]; h0 := iAh[s] END;
    IF iSt[s] = 4 THEN dw := mw; dh := RowH(ts)   (* a line that says why *)
    ELSIF (w0 <= 0) OR (h0 <= 0) THEN dw := mw; dh := 40   (* coming, its size not known yet *)
    ELSIF (iSt[s] = 3) & (w0 < 24) & (h0 < 24) THEN dw := 0; dh := 0   (* an icon *)
    ELSE
      dw := w0; IF dw > mw THEN dw := mw END;
      dh := h0 * dw DIV w0;
      IF dh > H - TOP - 120 THEN dh := H - TOP - 120; dw := w0 * dh DIV h0 END;
      IF dw < 1 THEN dw := 1 END;
      IF dh < 1 THEN dh := 1 END
    END
  END ImgSize;

  PROCEDURE BoxSize(i: INTEGER; VAR dw, dh: INTEGER);   (* a picture or a film of the page: how big *)
    VAR k: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    IF wK[i] = kImg THEN ImgSize(wS[i], dw, dh)
    ELSE
      k := wS[i]; dw := 0; dh := 0;
      IF mdPost[k] >= 0 THEN ImgSize(mdPost[k], dw, dh) END;
      IF (dh < 60) OR (iSt[mdPost[k]] = 4) THEN dw := 200; dh := 56 END   (* no poster: a PLAY button *)
    END
  END BoxSize;

  PROCEDURE Layout;
    VAR i, x, y, m, mm, wpx, dw, dh: INTEGER; open: BOOLEAN;
  BEGIN
    nr := 0; y := 4 * ts; x := MX; m := ts; open := FALSE; i := 0;
    WHILE i < nw DO
      IF wK[i] >= kPara THEN
        IF open THEN rW1[nr] := i; rHt[nr] := RowH(m); y := y + RowH(m); INC(nr); open := FALSE END;
        IF wK[i] = kPara THEN y := y + 5 * ts END
      ELSIF (wK[i] = kImg) OR (wK[i] = kVid) THEN   (* a picture or a film is a row of its own *)
        IF open THEN rW1[nr] := i; rHt[nr] := RowH(m); y := y + RowH(m); INC(nr); open := FALSE END;
        BoxSize(i, dw, dh);
        IF (dh > 0) & (nr < NR) THEN
          rW0[nr] := i; rW1[nr] := i + 1; rY[nr] := y; rM[nr] := ts; rHt[nr] := dh; wX[i] := MX; y := y + dh + 3 * ts; INC(nr)
        END
      ELSE
        IF wK[i] = kHead THEN mm := ts + 1 ELSE mm := ts END;
        wpx := wL[i] * 6 * mm;
        IF open & ((x + wpx > W - MX) OR (mm # m)) THEN rW1[nr] := i; rHt[nr] := RowH(m); y := y + RowH(m); INC(nr); open := FALSE END;
        IF ~open & (nr < NR) THEN rW0[nr] := i; rY[nr] := y; rM[nr] := mm; m := mm; x := MX; open := TRUE END;
        IF (x > MX) & (wL[i] > 0) & (wF[i] < 0) & Glue(pool[wS[i]]) THEN x := x - 6 * mm END;   (* , . ; : ) ! ? sit next to the word before *)
        wX[i] := x; x := x + wpx + 6 * mm
      END;
      IF nr >= NR THEN i := nw ELSE INC(i) END
    END;
    IF open & (nr < NR) THEN rW1[nr] := nw; rHt[nr] := RowH(m); y := y + RowH(m); INC(nr) END;
    totalH := y + 20
  END Layout;

  PROCEDURE Piece(i: INTEGER; VAR s: ARRAY OF CHAR);   (* the letters of word i *)
    VAR k: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    k := 0; WHILE (k < wL[i]) & (k < LEN(s) - 1) DO s[k] := pool[wS[i] + k]; INC(k) END; s[k] := 0X
  END Piece;

  PROCEDURE WordAt(x, y: INTEGER; any: BOOLEAN): INTEGER;   (* the link or field under the finger (any: any word); -1 *)
    VAR r, i, m, yy, res, dw, dh: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    res := -1; r := 0;
    WHILE (res < 0) & (r < nr) DO
      yy := TOP + scroll + rY[r]; m := rM[r]; i := rW0[r];
      IF (i < nw) & ((wK[i] = kImg) OR (wK[i] = kVid)) THEN
        BoxSize(i, dw, dh);
        IF (y >= yy) & (y < yy + dh) & (x >= wX[i]) & (x < wX[i] + dw) THEN res := i END
      ELSIF (y >= yy - 2 * m - 2) & (y < yy + 9 * m + 4) THEN
        WHILE (res < 0) & (i < rW1[r]) DO
          IF (any & (wK[i] < kPara) OR (wA[i] >= 0) OR (wF[i] >= 0)) & (x >= wX[i] - 10) & (x < wX[i] + wL[i] * 6 * m + 10) THEN res := i END;
          INC(i)
        END
      END;
      INC(r)
    END
    RETURN res
  END WordAt;


  (* ---------- pages of NORA's own ---------- *)

  PROCEDURE Link(label, u: ARRAY OF CHAR);
  BEGIN EndWord; inA := NewLink(u); EmitS(label); EndWord; inA := -1; Break(kLine)
  END Link;

  PROCEDURE Short(VAR s: ARRAY OF CHAR; n: INTEGER);
  BEGIN IF (n > 1) & (Len(s) > n) THEN s[n - 1] := "."; s[n] := 0X END
  END Short;

  PROCEDURE PutNum(VAR s: ARRAY OF CHAR; n: INTEGER);   (* a number at the end of s *)
    VAR d: ARRAY 12 OF CHAR; k: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    k := 0; IF n < 0 THEN n := 0 END;
    REPEAT d[k] := CHR(ORD("0") + n MOD 10); n := n DIV 10; INC(k) UNTIL n = 0;
    WHILE k > 0 DO DEC(k); AddC(s, d[k]) END
  END PutNum;

  (* ---------- your pages (the star) ---------- *)

  PROCEDURE LoadMarks;   (* nora-marks.txt: "URL TITLE" on each line *)
    VAR h, c, n, part: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    nmk := 0; h := Fisier.Deschide("nora-marks.txt");
    IF h >= 0 THEN
      c := Fisier.Citeste(h);
      WHILE (c >= 0) & (nmk < NM) DO
        mU[nmk][0] := 0X; mT[nmk][0] := 0X; n := 0; part := 0;
        WHILE (c >= 0) & (c # 10) DO
          IF (part = 0) & (c = 32) THEN part := 1; n := 0
          ELSIF c < 32 THEN (* nothing *)
          ELSIF part = 0 THEN IF n < LL - 1 THEN mU[nmk][n] := CHR(c); INC(n); mU[nmk][n] := 0X END
          ELSIF n < 63 THEN mT[nmk][n] := CHR(c); INC(n); mT[nmk][n] := 0X
          END;
          c := Fisier.Citeste(h)
        END;
        IF mU[nmk][0] # 0X THEN INC(nmk) END;
        IF c >= 0 THEN c := Fisier.Citeste(h) END
      END;
      Fisier.Gata(h)
    END
  END LoadMarks;

  PROCEDURE SaveMarks;
    VAR h, i: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    h := Fisier.Creeaza("nora-marks.txt");
    IF h >= 0 THEN
      FOR i := 0 TO nmk - 1 DO Put(h, mU[i]); Fisier.Scrie(h, 32); Put(h, mT[i]); Fisier.Scrie(h, 10) END;
      Fisier.Gata(h)
    END
  END SaveMarks;

  PROCEDURE MarkOf(VAR u: ARRAY OF CHAR): INTEGER;   (* where u is in your pages; -1 *)
    VAR i, r: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    r := -1; i := 0; WHILE (r < 0) & (i < nmk) DO IF Same(mU[i], u) THEN r := i END; INC(i) END
    RETURN r
  END MarkOf;

  (* ---------- the history ---------- *)

  PROCEDURE LoadHist;   (* nora-hist.txt: "URL TITLE" on each line, the newest first *)
    VAR h, c, n, part: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    nhi := 0; h := Fisier.Deschide("nora-hist.txt");
    IF h >= 0 THEN
      c := Fisier.Citeste(h);
      WHILE (c >= 0) & (nhi < NHI) DO
        hiU[nhi][0] := 0X; hiT[nhi][0] := 0X; n := 0; part := 0;
        WHILE (c >= 0) & (c # 10) DO
          IF (part = 0) & (c = 32) THEN part := 1; n := 0
          ELSIF c < 32 THEN (* nothing *)
          ELSIF part = 0 THEN IF n < LL - 1 THEN hiU[nhi][n] := CHR(c); INC(n); hiU[nhi][n] := 0X END
          ELSIF n < 63 THEN hiT[nhi][n] := CHR(c); INC(n); hiT[nhi][n] := 0X
          END;
          c := Fisier.Citeste(h)
        END;
        IF hiU[nhi][0] # 0X THEN INC(nhi) END;
        IF c >= 0 THEN c := Fisier.Citeste(h) END
      END;
      Fisier.Gata(h)
    END
  END LoadHist;

  PROCEDURE SaveHist;
    VAR h, i: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    h := Fisier.Creeaza("nora-hist.txt");
    IF h >= 0 THEN
      FOR i := 0 TO nhi - 1 DO Put(h, hiU[i]); Fisier.Scrie(h, 32); Put(h, hiT[i]); Fisier.Scrie(h, 10) END;
      Fisier.Gata(h)
    END
  END SaveHist;

  PROCEDURE AddHist;   (* the page that came: first in the history *)
    VAR i, k: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    IF (url[0] # 0X) & ~Starts(url, "nora:") & ~priv THEN   (* a private tab leaves no history *)
      k := 0; WHILE (k < nhi) & ~Same(hiU[k], url) DO INC(k) END;
      IF k = nhi THEN IF nhi < NHI THEN INC(nhi) END; k := nhi - 1 END;
      i := k; WHILE i > 0 DO Copy(hiU[i - 1], hiU[i]); Copy(hiT[i - 1], hiT[i]); DEC(i) END;
      Copy(url, hiU[0]);
      IF title[0] # 0X THEN Copy(title, hiT[0]) ELSE Copy(url, hiT[0]) END;
      SaveHist
    END
  END AddHist;

  PROCEDURE HistLink(i: INTEGER);
    VAR t: ARRAY LL OF CHAR;
  BEGIN
    IF hiT[i][0] # 0X THEN Copy(hiT[i], t) ELSE Copy(hiU[i], t) END;
    Short(t, 48); Link(t, hiU[i])
  END HistLink;

  PROCEDURE HistoryPage;
    VAR i: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    Reset; title := "History"; base := "nora:history"; curSlot := -1;
    head := 1; EmitS("Where you have been"); Break(kPara); head := 0;
    IF nhi = 0 THEN EmitS("Nowhere yet."); Break(kPara)
    ELSE FOR i := 0 TO nhi - 1 DO HistLink(i) END; Break(kPara); Link("Forget them all", "nora:forget")
    END;
    Link("Start page", "nora:start");
    Layout; scroll := 0
  END HistoryPage;

  PROCEDURE StartPage;
    VAR i: INTEGER; t: ARRAY LL OF CHAR;
  BEGIN
    Reset; Copy(name, title); base := "nora:start"; curSlot := -1;
    head := 1; EmitS(name); Break(kPara); head := 0;
    IF alone THEN
      EmitS("a fairy of her own. The phone brings the page, "); EmitS(name);
      EmitS(" keeps its words, links and pictures, here in Oberon, and the graphics card draws them."); Break(kPara)
    ELSE
      EmitS("the browser of the court. The host brings the page, "); EmitS(name);
      EmitS(" keeps only its words and links, here in Oberon, and the cube draws them."); Break(kPara)
    END;
    IF nmk > 0 THEN
      head := 2; EmitS("Your pages"); Break(kPara); head := 0;
      FOR i := nmk - 1 TO 0 BY -1 DO   (* the newest first *)
        IF mT[i][0] # 0X THEN Copy(mT[i], t) ELSE Copy(mU[i], t) END;
        Short(t, 48); Link(t, mU[i])
      END;
      Break(kPara)
    END;
    IF nhi > 0 THEN
      head := 2; EmitS("Lately"); Break(kPara); head := 0;
      i := 0; WHILE (i < nhi) & (i < 8) DO HistLink(i); INC(i) END;
      IF nhi > 8 THEN Link("all of them", "nora:history") END;
      Break(kPara)
    END;
    head := 2; EmitS("Start from here"); Break(kPara); head := 0;
    Link("Films given freely: PeerTube, the Internet Archive, Commons", "nora:films");
    IF nsv > 0 THEN Link("Saved pages, to read without the net", "nora:saved") END;
    Link("YouTube (in the window into the whole web)", "https://m.youtube.com/");
    Link("TikTok (in the window into the whole web)", "https://www.tiktok.com/");
    Link("Wikipedia in Romanian", "https://ro.m.wikipedia.org/");
    Link("Wikipedia in English", "https://en.m.wikipedia.org/");
    Link("NPR news, text only", "https://text.npr.org/");
    Link("CNN lite", "https://lite.cnn.com/");
    Link("Hacker News", "https://news.ycombinator.com/");
    Link("Marginalia, the search of the small web", "https://old-search.marginalia.nu/");
    Break(kPara);
    head := 2; EmitS("How"); Break(kPara); head := 0;
    EmitS("Tap the address bar to write. An address with a dot opens it, a few words are a search on Marginalia,"); EmitS(" and w and a few words a search on Wikipedia."); Break(kLine);
    EmitS("Drag the page to read on, tap a link to go there. BACK takes you to the page before, at once, from what she kept."); Break(kLine);
    EmitS("The star in the corner keeps the page in Your pages, here; tap it again to take it out."); Break(kLine);
    EmitS("Forms work: tap a field to write in it, tap a list for its next choice, and the button to send."); Break(kLine);
    EmitS("A- and A+ in the corner make the letters smaller or bigger."); Break(kLine);
    EmitS("To find a word in a page: tap the address bar, CLEAR, write it, FIND IN PAGE."); Break(kLine);
    EmitS("A link to a file (pdf, zip, apk ...) puts it in Download/CubicumN."); Break(kPara);
    EmitS("Pages made only of JavaScript (mail, banks) stay empty here."); EndWord;
    Layout; scroll := 0
  END StartPage;

  PROCEDURE ErrorPage(why: ARRAY OF CHAR);
    VAR u: ARRAY LL OF CHAR;
  BEGIN
    Copy(want, u);
    Reset; Copy(name, title); Copy(u, base); curSlot := -1;
    head := 1; EmitS("This page did not come"); Break(kPara); head := 0;
    EmitS(u); Break(kPara); EmitS(why); Break(kPara);
    Link("Try again", u); Link("Start page", "nora:start");
    Layout; scroll := 0
  END ErrorPage;

  (* ---------- going somewhere ---------- *)

  PROCEDURE SlotName(s: INTEGER; VAR nm: ARRAY OF CHAR);   (* nc0.htm .. nc23.htm *)
  BEGIN
    Copy("nc", nm); IF s >= 10 THEN AddC(nm, CHR(ORD("0") + s DIV 10)) END;
    AddC(nm, CHR(ORD("0") + s MOD 10)); Add(nm, ".htm")
  END SlotName;

  PROCEDURE PushHist;   (* the page you leave, where it is kept and where you were on it *)
    VAR i: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    IF url[0] # 0X THEN
      IF nh = NH THEN
        FOR i := 1 TO NH - 1 DO Copy(hist[i], hist[i - 1]); histS[i - 1] := histS[i]; histY[i - 1] := histY[i] END;
        DEC(nh)
      END;
      Copy(url, hist[nh]); histS[nh] := curSlot; histY[nh] := scroll; INC(nh)
    END
  END PushHist;

  (* ---------- the window into the whole web (NoraWeb, window 46) ---------- *)

  PROCEDURE WebSite(VAR u: ARRAY OF CHAR): BOOLEAN;   (* a site that is only JavaScript: it opens in the box *)
    VAR i, e: INTEGER; hst: ARRAY 120 OF CHAR;
  BEGIN
    i := Find(u, "://", 0); IF (i < 0) OR (i > 8) THEN i := 0 ELSE i := i + 3 END;
    e := 0; WHILE (i < LEN(u)) & (u[i] # 0X) & (u[i] # "/") & (u[i] # "?") & (u[i] # "#") & (e < LEN(hst) - 1) DO hst[e] := u[i]; INC(e); INC(i) END;
    hst[e] := 0X
    RETURN (Find(hst, "youtube.com", 0) >= 0) OR (Find(hst, "youtu.be", 0) >= 0) OR (Find(hst, "tiktok.com", 0) >= 0)
      OR (Find(hst, "vimeo.com", 0) >= 0) OR (Find(hst, "twitch.tv", 0) >= 0)
  END WebSite;

  PROCEDURE WebCmd(s: ARRAY OF CHAR);   (* webv.txt + webv-go: show, place, back, reload, hide *)
    VAR h: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    h := Fisier.Creeaza("webv.txt");
    IF h >= 0 THEN Put(h, s); Fisier.Scrie(h, 10); Fisier.Gata(h); Signal("webv-go") END
  END WebCmd;

  PROCEDURE WebOpen(VAR u: ARRAY OF CHAR);
    VAR s: ARRAY LL + 80 OF CHAR;
  BEGIN
    IF ~Gazda4.Hosted() THEN Say("NO HOST, NO WEB")
    ELSE
      webOn := TRUE; Copy(u, webUrl); webProg := 0; webBack := 0; tWeb := 0; tWebStart := Ceas.Ms(); down := TRUE; moved := TRUE;
      Copy("show 0 ", s); PutNum(s, TOP); AddC(s, " "); PutNum(s, W); AddC(s, " "); PutNum(s, H - 84 - TOP); AddC(s, " ");
      PutNum(s, W); AddC(s, " "); Add(s, u);
      WebCmd(s)
    END
  END WebOpen;

  PROCEDURE JsonGo(VAR t: ARRAY OF CHAR; push: BOOLEAN);   (* a search of free films: JSON, through the files of Web1 *)
    VAR h: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    IF push THEN PushHist; nRefresh := 0 END;
    Copy(t, want); posting := FALSE; resolving := FALSE;
    IF ~Gazda4.Hosted() THEN Copy(t, url); ErrorPage("There is no host under Pixipogo, so no net (bare metal)."); state := idle
    ELSE
      IF imgBusy THEN imgBusy := FALSE; IF imgSlot >= 0 THEN iSt[imgSlot] := 1 ELSIF imgSlot = -2 THEN dlSt := 1 ELSE vSt := 1 END END;
      INC(reqId); Fisier.Sterge("web-ok.txt");
      h := Fisier.Creeaza("web.txt");
      IF h >= 0 THEN
        PutN(h, reqId); Put(h, " GET "); Put(h, t); Fisier.Scrie(h, 10); Fisier.Gata(h);
        Signal("web-go"); state := asking; posting := TRUE; tAsk := Ceas.Ms(); tPoll := tAsk
      ELSE Copy(t, url); ErrorPage("Nora could not write web.txt."); state := idle
      END
    END
  END JsonGo;

  PROCEDURE FilmAsk(VAR u: ARRAY OF CHAR);   (* nora:play?ADDRESS: ask the details of a free film; the page stays *)
    VAR h, i, j: INTEGER; t, u2: ARRAY LL OF CHAR;
  BEGIN
    IF ~Gazda4.Hosted() THEN Say("NO HOST, NO FILM")
    ELSE
      i := 10; j := 0; WHILE (u[i] # 0X) & (j < LL - 1) DO resWant[j] := u[i]; INC(i); INC(j) END; resWant[j] := 0X;
      (* the film's own page, for when her player cannot play it *)
      Copy(resWant, resWatch); i := Find(resWatch, "/api/v1/videos/", 0);
      IF i > 0 THEN Cut(resWatch, i, 15); j := i; Copy(resWatch, t); t[j] := 0X; Add(t, "/videos/watch/"); Copy(resWatch, u2); Cut(u2, 0, j); Add(t, u2); Copy(t, resWatch)
      ELSIF Starts(resWatch, "https://archive.org/metadata/") THEN Cut(resWatch, 0, 29); Copy("https://archive.org/details/", t); Add(t, resWatch); Copy(t, resWatch)
      END;
      IF imgBusy THEN imgBusy := FALSE; IF imgSlot >= 0 THEN iSt[imgSlot] := 1 ELSIF imgSlot = -2 THEN dlSt := 1 ELSE vSt := 1 END END;
      INC(reqId); Fisier.Sterge("web-ok.txt");
      h := Fisier.Creeaza("web.txt");   (* JSON: through the files of Web1 (the net of pages takes only pages) *)
      IF h >= 0 THEN
        PutN(h, reqId); Put(h, " GET "); Put(h, resWant); Fisier.Scrie(h, 10); Fisier.Gata(h);
        Signal("web-go"); resolving := TRUE; posting := TRUE; Copy(url, want); state := asking; tAsk := Ceas.Ms(); tPoll := tAsk;
        Say("LOOKING FOR THE FILM")
      END
    END
  END FilmAsk;

  (* ---------- saved pages: nora-saved.txt "N URL TITLE", the page in nora-svN.htm ---------- *)

  PROCEDURE SvName(n: INTEGER; VAR nm: ARRAY OF CHAR);
  BEGIN Copy("nora-sv", nm); PutNum(nm, n); Add(nm, ".htm")
  END SvName;

  PROCEDURE LoadSaved;
    VAR h, c, n, part, k: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    nsv := 0; h := Fisier.Deschide("nora-saved.txt");
    IF h >= 0 THEN
      c := Fisier.Citeste(h);
      WHILE (c >= 0) & (nsv < NSV) DO
        svU[nsv][0] := 0X; svT[nsv][0] := 0X; k := 0; n := 0; part := 0;
        WHILE (c >= 0) & (c # 10) DO
          IF (part < 2) & (c = 32) THEN INC(part); n := 0
          ELSIF c < 32 THEN (* nothing *)
          ELSIF part = 0 THEN IF (c >= ORD("0")) & (c <= ORD("9")) THEN k := k * 10 + c - ORD("0") END
          ELSIF part = 1 THEN IF n < LL - 1 THEN svU[nsv][n] := CHR(c); INC(n); svU[nsv][n] := 0X END
          ELSIF n < 63 THEN svT[nsv][n] := CHR(c); INC(n); svT[nsv][n] := 0X
          END;
          c := Fisier.Citeste(h)
        END;
        IF svU[nsv][0] # 0X THEN svN[nsv] := k; INC(nsv) END;
        IF c >= 0 THEN c := Fisier.Citeste(h) END
      END;
      Fisier.Gata(h)
    END
  END LoadSaved;

  PROCEDURE StoreSaved;
    VAR h, i: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    h := Fisier.Creeaza("nora-saved.txt");
    IF h >= 0 THEN
      FOR i := 0 TO nsv - 1 DO PutN(h, svN[i]); Fisier.Scrie(h, 32); Put(h, svU[i]); Fisier.Scrie(h, 32); Put(h, svT[i]); Fisier.Scrie(h, 10) END;
      Fisier.Gata(h)
    END
  END StoreSaved;

  PROCEDURE SavedPage;   (* nora:saved *)
    VAR i: INTEGER; t, u: ARRAY LL OF CHAR;
  BEGIN
    Reset; title := "Saved pages"; base := "nora:saved"; curSlot := -1;
    head := 1; EmitS("Saved pages"); Break(kPara); head := 0;
    IF nsv = 0 THEN
      EmitS("None yet. Hold your finger on the address bar of a page, then SAVE: it stays on the phone, to read without the net."); Break(kPara)
    ELSE
      FOR i := 0 TO nsv - 1 DO
        Copy(svT[i], t); Short(t, 48); u := "nora:saved?"; PutNum(u, i); Link(t, u);
        u := "nora:unsave?"; PutNum(u, i); Link("   remove it", u)
      END
    END;
    Break(kPara); Link("Start page", "nora:start");
    Layout; scroll := 0
  END SavedPage;

  PROCEDURE TailNum(VAR t: ARRAY OF CHAR): INTEGER;   (* the number after the ? *)
    VAR i, n: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    i := Find(t, "?", 0) + 1; n := 0;
    WHILE (i > 0) & (t[i] >= "0") & (t[i] <= "9") DO n := n * 10 + ORD(t[i]) - ORD("0"); INC(i) END
    RETURN n
  END TailNum;

  PROCEDURE OpenSaved(k: INTEGER);   (* a saved page, from the phone *)
    VAR nm: ARRAY 24 OF CHAR;
  BEGIN
    IF (k >= 0) & (k < nsv) THEN
      Copy(svU[k], url); Copy(url, want); Copy(url, base); SvName(svN[k], nm);
      Parse(nm, ""); Layout; scroll := 0; curSlot := -1; state := idle; Say("A SAVED PAGE (WITHOUT THE NET)")
    ELSE SavedPage; url := "nora:saved"; state := idle
    END
  END OpenSaved;

  PROCEDURE Unsave(k: INTEGER);
    VAR i: INTEGER; nm: ARRAY 24 OF CHAR;
  BEGIN
    IF (k >= 0) & (k < nsv) THEN
      SvName(svN[k], nm); Fisier.Sterge(nm);
      FOR i := k TO nsv - 2 DO Copy(svU[i + 1], svU[i]); Copy(svT[i + 1], svT[i]); svN[i] := svN[i + 1] END;
      DEC(nsv); StoreSaved
    END
  END Unsave;

  PROCEDURE FilmsPage;   (* nora:films *)
    VAR u: ARRAY LL OF CHAR;
  BEGIN
    Reset; title := "Films"; base := "nora:films"; curSlot := -1;
    head := 1; EmitS("Films given freely"); Break(kPara); head := 0;
    EmitS("Here the films are given on purpose: PeerTube (many small servers, like a YouTube of everybody), the Internet");
    EmitS(" Archive (old films, cartoons, concerts) and Wikimedia Commons (the films of Wikipedia). "); EmitS(name);
    EmitS(" reads their lists herself, in Oberon, and plays them in her player."); Break(kPara);
    EmitS("Write in the address bar:  pt cats  (PeerTube),  ia popeye  (the Internet Archive),  wc volcano  (Commons)."); Break(kPara);
    head := 2; EmitS("Try"); Break(kPara); head := 0;
    Filme1.Search(1, "nature", u); Link("Nature, on PeerTube", u);
    Filme1.Search(1, "music", u); Link("Music, on PeerTube", u);
    Filme1.Search(2, "popeye", u); Link("Popeye, on the Internet Archive", u);
    Filme1.Search(2, "betty boop", u); Link("Betty Boop, on the Internet Archive", u);
    Filme1.Search(2, "charlie chaplin", u); Link("Charlie Chaplin, on the Internet Archive", u);
    Filme1.Search(3, "volcano", u); Link("Volcanoes, on Wikimedia Commons", u);
    Filme1.Search(3, "cat", u); Link("Cats, on Wikimedia Commons", u);
    Break(kPara); Link("Start page", "nora:start");
    Layout; scroll := 0
  END FilmsPage;

  PROCEDURE Go(u: ARRAY OF CHAR; push: BOOLEAN);
    VAR h: INTEGER; t: ARRAY LL OF CHAR;
  BEGIN
    Copy(u, t);
    resolving := FALSE;
    IF WebSite(t) & Gazda4.Hosted() THEN WebOpen(t)   (* YouTube, TikTok ...: in the box *)
    ELSIF Starts(t, "nora:play?") THEN FilmAsk(t)   (* a free film: where its file is *)
    ELSIF (Filme1.Kind(t) >= 1) & (Filme1.Kind(t) <= 3) THEN JsonGo(t, push)   (* a search of free films *)
    ELSE
    IF push THEN PushHist; nRefresh := 0 END;
    Copy(t, want); posting := FALSE;
    IF Same(t, "nora:start") THEN StartPage; Copy(t, url); state := idle
    ELSIF Same(t, "nora:history") THEN HistoryPage; Copy(t, url); state := idle
    ELSIF Same(t, "nora:films") THEN FilmsPage; Copy(t, url); state := idle
    ELSIF Same(t, "nora:saved") THEN SavedPage; Copy(t, url); state := idle
    ELSIF Starts(t, "nora:saved?") THEN OpenSaved(TailNum(t))
    ELSIF Starts(t, "nora:unsave?") THEN Unsave(TailNum(t)); SavedPage; url := "nora:saved"; state := idle
    ELSIF Same(t, "nora:forget") THEN nhi := 0; SaveHist; StartPage; Copy("nora:start", url); state := idle
    ELSIF ~Gazda4.Hosted() THEN Copy(t, url); ErrorPage("There is no host under Pixipogo, so no net (bare metal)."); state := idle
    ELSE
      INC(reqId); Fisier.Sterge("net-ok.txt");
      h := Fisier.Creeaza("net.txt");
      IF h >= 0 THEN
        PutN(h, reqId); Fisier.Scrie(h, 32); Put(h, t); Fisier.Scrie(h, 10); Fisier.Gata(h);
        Signal("net-go"); state := asking; tAsk := Ceas.Ms(); tPoll := tAsk
      ELSE Copy(t, url); ErrorPage("Nora could not write net.txt."); state := idle
      END
    END
    END
  END Go;

  PROCEDURE PostGo(u, body: ARRAY OF CHAR);   (* a form sent with POST, through the files of Web1 *)
    VAR h: INTEGER; t: ARRAY LL OF CHAR;
  BEGIN
    Copy(u, t); PushHist; Copy(t, want); posting := FALSE; resolving := FALSE;
    IF ~Gazda4.Hosted() THEN Copy(t, url); ErrorPage("There is no host under Pixipogo, so no net (bare metal)."); state := idle
    ELSE
      IF imgBusy THEN imgBusy := FALSE; IF imgSlot >= 0 THEN iSt[imgSlot] := 1 ELSIF imgSlot = -2 THEN dlSt := 1 ELSE vSt := 1 END END;   (* the picture being asked for waits: the form goes first *)
      INC(reqId); Fisier.Sterge("web-ok.txt");
      h := Fisier.Creeaza("web-body.txt"); IF h >= 0 THEN Put(h, body); Fisier.Gata(h) END;
      h := Fisier.Creeaza("web.txt");
      IF h >= 0 THEN
        PutN(h, reqId); Put(h, " POST "); Put(h, t); Put(h, " application/x-www-form-urlencoded"); Fisier.Scrie(h, 10); Fisier.Gata(h);
        Signal("web-go"); state := asking; posting := TRUE; tAsk := Ceas.Ms(); tPoll := tAsk
      ELSE Copy(t, url); ErrorPage("Nora could not write web.txt."); state := idle
      END
    END
  END PostGo;

  PROCEDURE Kept(s: INTEGER): BOOLEAN;   (* is page s still on the disk? *)
    VAR h: INTEGER; nm: ARRAY 16 OF CHAR; ok: BOOLEAN;
  BEGIN
    ok := FALSE;
    IF (s >= 0) & (s < NC) THEN SlotName(s, nm); h := Fisier.Deschide(nm); IF h >= 0 THEN Fisier.Gata(h); ok := TRUE END END
    RETURN ok
  END Kept;

  PROCEDURE Back;   (* from what was kept, at once; from the net only when it is not there any more *)
    VAR t: ARRAY LL OF CHAR; nm: ARRAY 16 OF CHAR; s, y: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    resolving := FALSE;
    IF nh > 0 THEN
      DEC(nh); Copy(hist[nh], t); s := histS[nh]; y := histY[nh]; nRefresh := 0;
      IF Same(t, "nora:start") THEN
        INC(reqId); state := idle; posting := FALSE; Copy(t, url); Copy(t, want); StartPage; scroll := y
      ELSIF (s >= 0) & Same(slotUrl[s], t) & Kept(s) THEN
        INC(reqId); state := idle; posting := FALSE; Copy(t, url); Copy(t, want); Copy(t, base);
        SlotName(s, nm); Parse(nm, ""); Layout; curSlot := s; scroll := y
      ELSE Go(t, FALSE)
      END
    ELSE Say("NOTHING BEHIND")
    END
  END Back;

  PROCEDURE ReadLine(h: INTEGER; VAR s: ARRAY OF CHAR);
    VAR c, n: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    n := 0; c := Fisier.Citeste(h);
    WHILE (c >= 0) & (c # 10) DO IF (c >= 32) & (c < 127) & (n < LEN(s) - 1) THEN s[n] := CHR(c); INC(n) END; c := Fisier.Citeste(h) END;
    s[n] := 0X
  END ReadLine;

  PROCEDURE Word(VAR s: ARRAY OF CHAR; k: INTEGER; VAR d: ARRAY OF CHAR);   (* word k of s; with k < 0: from word -k to the end *)
    VAR i, j, w, kk: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    kk := ABS(k); i := 0; w := 0;
    WHILE (s[i] # 0X) & (w < kk) DO
      WHILE (s[i] # 0X) & (s[i] # " ") DO INC(i) END;
      WHILE s[i] = " " DO INC(i) END;
      INC(w)
    END;
    j := 0;
    WHILE (s[i] # 0X) & ((k < 0) OR (s[i] # " ")) & (j < LEN(d) - 1) DO d[j] := s[i]; INC(i); INC(j) END;
    d[j] := 0X
  END Word;

  PROCEDURE Num(VAR s: ARRAY OF CHAR): INTEGER;
    VAR i, v: INTEGER;
  BEGIN i := 0; v := 0; WHILE (s[i] >= "0") & (s[i] <= "9") DO v := v * 10 + ORD(s[i]) - ORD("0"); INC(i) END
    RETURN v
  END Num;

  (* ---------- downloads ---------- *)

  PROCEDURE UpperS(VAR s: ARRAY OF CHAR);   (* for the messages: the letters of OllGL6 are capitals *)
    VAR i: INTEGER;
  BEGIN i := 0; WHILE (i < LEN(s)) & (s[i] # 0X) DO IF (s[i] >= "a") & (s[i] <= "z") THEN s[i] := CHR(ORD(s[i]) - 32) END; INC(i) END
  END UpperS;

  PROCEDURE FileName(VAR u, nm: ARRAY OF CHAR);   (* the last part of the address, with only safe letters *)
    VAR i, k, j: INTEGER; c: CHAR; u2: ARRAY 64 OF CHAR;
  BEGIN
    i := 0; k := 0;
    WHILE (i < LEN(u)) & (u[i] # 0X) & (u[i] # "?") & (u[i] # "#") DO IF u[i] = "/" THEN k := i + 1 END; INC(i) END;
    j := 0;
    WHILE (k < i) & (j < LEN(nm) - 1) DO
      c := u[k];
      IF ((c >= "a") & (c <= "z")) OR ((c >= "A") & (c <= "Z")) OR ((c >= "0") & (c <= "9")) OR (c = ".") OR (c = "-") OR (c = "_") THEN
        nm[j] := c; INC(j)
      ELSIF (c = "%") & (k + 2 < i) THEN nm[j] := "_"; INC(j); k := k + 2
      END;
      INC(k)
    END;
    nm[j] := 0X;
    IF (j = 0) OR (nm[0] = ".") THEN Copy("download.bin", nm) END;
    IF Starts(nm, "web") OR Starts(nm, "net") OR Starts(nm, "nora") OR Starts(nm, "vid") OR Starts(nm, "clip")
        OR Starts(nm, "nc") THEN   (* not over a file of NoraChick or of the window *)
      Copy(nm, u2); Copy("dl-", nm); Add(nm, u2)
    END
  END FileName;

  PROCEDURE StartDl(VAR u: ARRAY OF CHAR);
    VAR s: ARRAY 100 OF CHAR; t: ARRAY LL + 120 OF CHAR;
  BEGIN
    IF ~Gazda4.Hosted() THEN Say("NO HOST, NO DOWNLOADS")
    ELSE   (* the phone's downloader: any size, to Download, with its notification (window 48) *)
      FileName(u, dlName); IF dlName[0] = 0X THEN dlName := "file" END;
      Copy("get ", t); Add(t, dlName); AddC(t, " "); Add(t, u); WebCmd(t);
      Copy("DOWNLOADING ", s); Add(s, dlName); UpperS(s); Say(s); tMsg := 200
    END
  END StartDl;

  PROCEDURE DlCame(VAR line: ARRAY OF CHAR; code: INTEGER);   (* the file is in web.dat: to its name, then to Download *)
    VAR hi, ho, b: INTEGER; w: ARRAY 24 OF CHAR;
  BEGIN
    IF (line[0] = "1") & (code >= 200) & (code < 300) THEN
      Word(line, 3, w); dlSize := Num(w);
      hi := Fisier.Deschide("web.dat"); ho := Fisier.Creeaza(dlName);
      IF (hi >= 0) & (ho >= 0) THEN
        b := Fisier.Citeste(hi); WHILE b >= 0 DO Fisier.Scrie(ho, b); b := Fisier.Citeste(hi) END;
        Fisier.Gata(hi); Fisier.Gata(ho);
        Gazda4.Export(dlName); dlSt := 3
      ELSE
        IF hi >= 0 THEN Fisier.Gata(hi) END; IF ho >= 0 THEN Fisier.Gata(ho) END;
        dlSt := 0; Say("COULD NOT KEEP THE FILE")
      END
    ELSE dlSt := 0; Say("THE FILE DID NOT COME")
    END
  END DlCame;

  PROCEDURE DlPoll;   (* the window puts it in Download/CubicumN *)
    VAR st: INTEGER; s: ARRAY 120 OF CHAR; p: ARRAY 100 OF CHAR;
  BEGIN
    IF dlSt = 3 THEN
      st := Gazda4.ExportState();
      IF st = 2 THEN
        Gazda4.ExportPath(p); Gazda4.ExportDone; Fisier.Sterge(dlName); dlSt := 0;
        IF dlSize >= 4194304 THEN Copy("ONLY THE FIRST 4 MB: ", s) ELSE Copy("SAVED: ", s) END;
        Add(s, p); UpperS(s); Say(s); tMsg := 250
      ELSIF st = 3 THEN Gazda4.ExportDone; Fisier.Sterge(dlName); dlSt := 0; Say("COULD NOT SAVE IT IN DOWNLOAD")
      END
    END
  END DlPoll;

  PROCEDURE Shade(v, q: INTEGER): INTEGER;   (* a colour of Pic5 (as RGBA) -> r * 65536 + g * 256 + b, in steps of q *)
    VAR r, g, b: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    IF v < 0 THEN v := v + 2147483647 + 1 END;
    v := v MOD 16777216; r := v MOD 256; g := v DIV 256 MOD 256; b := v DIV 65536
    RETURN (r DIV q * q + q DIV 2) * 65536 + (g DIV q * q + q DIV 2) * 256 + b DIV q * q + q DIV 2
  END Shade;

  PROCEDURE ToTex(slot: INTEGER);   (* the picture Pic5 has just read -> the graphics card *)
    VAR k, n: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    n := Pic6.cw * Pic6.ch;
    OllGL7.IncepeTextura(slot, Pic6.cw, Pic6.ch);
    FOR k := 0 TO n - 1 DO OllGL7.PixelTextura(Pic6.pix[k]) END;
    OllGL7.GataTextura
  END ToTex;

  PROCEDURE ImgPoll;   (* the pictures of the page, one at a time, through the Web1 files *)
    VAR h, s, k, now, code: INTEGER; ok: BOOLEAN; line: ARRAY 200 OF CHAR; w: ARRAY 40 OF CHAR;
  BEGIN
    now := Ceas.Ms();
    IF imgBusy THEN
      IF now - tImgPoll >= 150 THEN
        tImgPoll := now;
        h := Fisier.Deschide("web-ok.txt");
        IF h >= 0 THEN
          ReadLine(h, line); Fisier.Gata(h); Word(line, 1, w);
          IF Num(w) = imgId THEN
            Fisier.Sterge("web-ok.txt"); imgBusy := FALSE; s := imgSlot;
            Word(line, 2, w); code := Num(w);
            IF s = -2 THEN DlCame(line, code)
            ELSIF s < 0 THEN   (* the big one *)
              vTex := FALSE;
              IF (line[0] = "1") & (code >= 200) & (code < 300) & OllGL7.Texturi() & Pic6.Load("web.dat", BIGPX) THEN
                vCw := Pic6.cw; vCh := Pic6.ch; ToTex(BIGTEX); vTex := TRUE; vSt := 3
              ELSIF (line[0] = "1") & (code >= 200) & (code < 300) & Pic6.Load("web.dat", BIG) THEN
                vCw := Pic6.cw; vCh := Pic6.ch;
                FOR k := 0 TO vCw * vCh - 1 DO vPix[k] := Shade(Pic6.pix[k], 4) END;   (* 64 shades a colour *)
                vSt := 3
              ELSE vSt := 4
              END
            ELSIF (line[0] = "1") & (code >= 200) & (code < 300) THEN
              iTex[s] := OllGL7.Texturi();
              IF iTex[s] THEN ok := Pic6.Load("web.dat", PAGEPX) ELSE ok := Pic6.Load("web.dat", 64) END;
              IF ok THEN
                iW[s] := Pic6.W; iH[s] := Pic6.H; iCw[s] := Pic6.cw; iCh[s] := Pic6.ch;
                IF iTex[s] THEN ToTex(s)
                ELSE   (* 32 shades a colour: more squares of one colour, fewer triangles *)
                  FOR k := 0 TO Pic6.cw * Pic6.ch - 1 DO iPix[s * CELLS + k] := Shade(Pic6.pix[k], 8) END
                END;
                iSt[s] := 3
              ELSE iSt[s] := 4; iTex[s] := FALSE; Copy(Pic6.why, iWhy[s])
              END
            ELSIF line[0] = "1" THEN iSt[s] := 4; Copy("not there", iWhy[s])
            ELSE iSt[s] := 4; Copy("did not come", iWhy[s])
            END;
            Layout
          END
        ELSIF (now - tImg > 25000) & ((imgSlot # -2) OR (now - tImg > 120000)) THEN
          imgBusy := FALSE;
          IF imgSlot = -2 THEN dlSt := 0; Say("THE FILE DID NOT COME IN 2 MINUTES")
          ELSIF imgSlot < 0 THEN vSt := 4 ELSE iSt[imgSlot] := 4; Copy("no answer", iWhy[imgSlot]); Layout
          END
        END
      END
    ELSIF (state = idle) & ~posting & Gazda4.Hosted() THEN
      IF viewing & (vSt = 1) THEN s := -1   (* the big one first *)
      ELSIF dlSt = 1 THEN s := -2   (* then a download *)
      ELSE s := 0; WHILE (s < NI) & ~((iSt[s] = 1) & (iUse[s] = pageGen)) DO INC(s) END
      END;
      IF s < NI THEN
        INC(imgId); Fisier.Sterge("web-ok.txt");
        h := Fisier.Creeaza("web.txt");
        IF h >= 0 THEN
          PutN(h, imgId); Put(h, " GET ");
          IF s = -2 THEN Put(h, dlUrl); dlSt := 2 ELSIF s < 0 THEN Put(h, iUrl[vSlot]); vSt := 2 ELSE Put(h, iUrl[s]); iSt[s] := 2 END;
          Fisier.Scrie(h, 10); Fisier.Gata(h);
          Signal("web-go"); imgBusy := TRUE; imgSlot := s; tImg := now; tImgPoll := now
        END
      END
    END
  END ImgPoll;

  PROCEDURE Poll;
    VAR h, now, s, k: INTEGER; line: ARRAY 700 OF CHAR; w: ARRAY LL OF CHAR; nm: ARRAY 16 OF CHAR;
  BEGIN
    now := Ceas.Ms();
    ImgPoll; DlPoll;
    IF (state = idle) & (refreshAt # 0) & (now >= refreshAt) THEN   (* the page asked to come again *)
      refreshAt := 0; IF nRefresh < 5 THEN INC(nRefresh); Say("AGAIN, AS THE PAGE ASKED"); Go(refreshUrl, FALSE) END
    END;
    IF (state = asking) & (now - tPoll >= 200) THEN
      tPoll := now;
      IF posting THEN h := Fisier.Deschide("web-ok.txt") ELSE h := Fisier.Deschide("net-ok.txt") END;
      IF h >= 0 THEN
        ReadLine(h, line); Fisier.Gata(h); Word(line, 1, w);
        IF Num(w) = reqId THEN
          IF posting THEN Fisier.Sterge("web-ok.txt") ELSE Fisier.Sterge("net-ok.txt") END;
          IF resolving THEN   (* the details of a free film: its file, and the page stays *)
            resolving := FALSE; state := idle; posting := FALSE;
            IF (line[0] = "1") & Filme1.Pick("web.dat", resWant, w) THEN Copy(w, pendPlay); Copy(resWatch, fallWeb)
            ELSIF resWatch[0] # 0X THEN WebOpen(resWatch)   (* no file for her player: the film's own page, its own player *)
            ELSE Say("NO FILE OF THIS FILM THAT THE PHONE CAN PLAY")
            END
          ELSIF line[0] = "1" THEN
            IF posting THEN src := "web.dat"; Copy(want, w)   (* "1 ID CODE SIZE": the page has the address of the form *)
            ELSE src := "net.html"; Word(line, 3, w); IF w[0] = 0X THEN Copy(want, w) END
            END;
            Copy(w, base); Copy(w, url); state := arrived
          ELSE Word(line, -2, w); Copy(want, url); posting := FALSE; ErrorPage(w); state := idle
          END
        END
      ELSIF (now - tAsk > 30000) & resolving THEN resolving := FALSE; state := idle; posting := FALSE; Say("THE FILM DID NOT ANSWER")
      ELSIF now - tAsk > 30000 THEN
        Copy(want, url); posting := FALSE;
        ErrorPage("No answer from the window. Nora needs the window ecran-cubn40.dex, which brings the net.");
        state := idle
      END
    ELSIF state = arrived THEN   (* the frame before showed LOADING; now the reading, and a copy kept for BACK *)
      viewing := FALSE;   (* a picture seen big belongs to the page before *)
      s := nextSlot; nextSlot := (nextSlot + 1) MOD NC; SlotName(s, nm); slotUrl[s][0] := 0X;
      k := Filme1.Kind(want); IF (k < 1) OR (k > 3) THEN k := Filme1.Kind(url) END;
      IF (k >= 1) & (k <= 3) & Filme1.ToHtml(src, "films.html", k) THEN Parse("films.html", nm)   (* a search of free films *)
      ELSE Parse(src, nm)
      END;
      Copy(url, slotUrl[s]); curSlot := s;
      Layout; scroll := 0; state := idle; posting := FALSE; AddHist;
      IF title[0] # 0X THEN Copy(title, w); w[40] := 0X; Say(w) END
    END
  END Poll;

  PROCEDURE Submit;   (* what was written in the address bar *)
    VAR s, u: ARRAY LL OF CHAR; i, j, c: INTEGER; hexd: ARRAY 17 OF CHAR;
  BEGIN
    i := 0; WHILE edit[i] = " " DO INC(i) END;
    j := 0; WHILE (edit[i] # 0X) & (j < LL - 1) DO s[j] := edit[i]; INC(i); INC(j) END; s[j] := 0X;
    WHILE (j > 0) & (s[j - 1] = " ") DO DEC(j); s[j] := 0X END;
    IF s[0] # 0X THEN
      IF Find(s, "://", 0) > 0 THEN
        IF IsMedia(s) THEN Copy(s, pendPlay) ELSIF IsFile(s) THEN Copy(s, dlUrl); dlSt := -1 ELSE Go(s, TRUE) END   (* a film, a file *)
      ELSIF Same(s, "nora:start") OR Same(s, "nora:films") THEN Go(s, TRUE)
      ELSIF (s[2] = " ") & (s[3] # 0X) & (((s[0] = "p") & (s[1] = "t")) OR ((s[0] = "i") & (s[1] = "a")) OR ((s[0] = "w") & (s[1] = "c"))) THEN
        IF s[0] = "p" THEN i := 1 ELSIF s[0] = "i" THEN i := 2 ELSE i := 3 END;   (* pt, ia, wc: the free films *)
        Cut(s, 0, 3); Filme1.Search(i, s, u); Go(u, TRUE)
      ELSIF (Find(s, ".", 0) > 0) & (Find(s, " ", 0) < 0) THEN
        u := "https://"; Add(u, s);
        IF IsMedia(u) THEN Copy(u, pendPlay) ELSIF IsFile(u) THEN Copy(u, dlUrl); dlSt := -1 ELSE Go(u, TRUE) END
      ELSE
        hexd := "0123456789ABCDEF"; i := 0;
        IF ((s[0] = "w") OR (s[0] = "W")) & (s[1] = " ") THEN u := "https://ro.m.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?search="; i := 2
        ELSE u := "https://old-search.marginalia.nu/search?query="
        END;
        WHILE s[i] # 0X DO
          c := ORD(s[i]) MOD 256;
          IF IsAlnum(c) OR (s[i] = "-") OR (s[i] = "_") OR (s[i] = ".") THEN AddC(u, s[i])
          ELSIF s[i] = " " THEN AddC(u, "+")
          ELSE AddC(u, "%"); AddC(u, hexd[c DIV 16]); AddC(u, hexd[c MOD 16])
          END;
          INC(i)
        END;
        Go(u, TRUE)
      END
    END
  END Submit;

  PROCEDURE Shown(VAR s: ARRAY OF CHAR);   (* the address without https:// and www. *)
    VAR i: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    IF state = asking THEN Copy(want, s) ELSE Copy(url, s) END;
    IF Same(s, "nora:start") THEN Copy("START PAGE . TAP TO WRITE", s) END;
    i := Find(s, "://", 0); IF (i > 0) & (i < 10) THEN Cut(s, 0, i + 3) END;
    IF Starts(s, "www.") THEN Cut(s, 0, 4) END
  END Shown;

  PROCEDURE ToggleMark;   (* the star *)
    VAR k, i: INTEGER; t: ARRAY LL OF CHAR;
  BEGIN
    IF (state # idle) OR (curSlot < 0) THEN Say("NOTHING TO KEEP HERE")
    ELSE
      k := MarkOf(url);
      IF k >= 0 THEN
        FOR i := k TO nmk - 2 DO Copy(mU[i + 1], mU[i]); Copy(mT[i + 1], mT[i]) END;
        DEC(nmk); SaveMarks; Say("OUT OF YOUR PAGES")
      ELSIF nmk < NM THEN
        IF title[0] # 0X THEN Copy(title, t) ELSE Shown(t) END;
        t[60] := 0X; Copy(url, mU[nmk]); Copy(t, mT[nmk]); INC(nmk); SaveMarks; Say("KEPT IN YOUR PAGES")
      ELSE Say("YOUR PAGES ARE FULL: 100")
      END
    END
  END ToggleMark;

  (* ---------- copy and paste (the window's clipboard files: clip-out.txt + clip-go, clip-req -> clip-in.txt) ---------- *)

  PROCEDURE CopyOut(VAR s: ARRAY OF CHAR);   (* s to the phone's clipboard, with its Romanian letters *)
    VAR h: INTEGER; u: ARRAY 8000 OF CHAR;
  BEGIN
    ToUtf(s, u); h := Fisier.Creeaza("clip-out.txt");
    IF h >= 0 THEN Put(h, u); Fisier.Gata(h); Signal("clip-go") END
  END CopyOut;

  PROCEDURE CopyPara(i: INTEGER);   (* the paragraph of word i, its lines as lines *)
    VAR a, b, k: INTEGER; s: ARRAY 8000 OF CHAR; p: ARRAY 160 OF CHAR;
  BEGIN
    a := i; WHILE (a > 0) & (wK[a - 1] # kPara) DO DEC(a) END;
    b := i; WHILE (b < nw) & (wK[b] # kPara) DO INC(b) END;
    s[0] := 0X;
    FOR k := a TO b - 1 DO
      IF wK[k] = kLine THEN IF s[0] # 0X THEN AddC(s, 0AX) END
      ELSIF (wK[k] < kPara) & (wF[k] < 0) & (wK[k] # kImg) & (wK[k] # kVid) THEN
        Piece(k, p);
        IF (s[0] # 0X) & (s[Len(s) - 1] # 0AX) & ~Glue(p[0]) THEN AddC(s, " ") END;
        Add(s, p)
      END
    END;
    CopyOut(s)
  END CopyPara;

  PROCEDURE LongPress(x, y: INTEGER);   (* a finger held still: copy *)
    VAR i: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    IF (y >= 100) & (y < 162) THEN
      IF (url[0] = 0X) OR Starts(url, "nora:") THEN Say("A PAGE OF HER OWN: NOTHING TO SAVE OR SHARE")
      ELSE Copy(url, menuUrl); menuKind := 2; menuOn := TRUE   (* SAVE, COPY, SHARE, COMPUTER / PHONE *)
      END
    ELSIF (y >= TOP) & (y < H - 84) THEN
      i := WordAt(x, y, TRUE);
      IF i < 0 THEN (* nothing *)
      ELSIF wA[i] >= 0 THEN Copy(links[wA[i]], menuUrl); menuKind := 1; menuOn := TRUE   (* NEW TAB, COPY, SHARE, PRIVATE *)
      ELSIF wK[i] = kImg THEN CopyOut(iUrl[wS[i]]); Say("PICTURE ADDRESS COPIED")
      ELSIF wK[i] = kVid THEN CopyOut(mdUrl[wS[i]]); Say("FILM ADDRESS COPIED")
      ELSIF wF[i] < 0 THEN CopyPara(i); Say("PARAGRAPH COPIED")
      END
    END
  END LongPress;

  PROCEDURE AskPaste;
  BEGIN Fisier.Sterge("clip-in.txt"); Signal("clip-req"); pasteT := Ceas.Ms(); IF pasteT = 0 THEN pasteT := 1 END
  END AskPaste;

  PROCEDURE PollPaste;   (* the clipboard came: into what you write, at the cursor *)
    VAR h, c, i: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    IF pasteT # 0 THEN
      h := Fisier.Deschide("clip-in.txt");
      IF h >= 0 THEN
        c := Fisier.Citeste(h);
        WHILE (c >= 0) & (Len(edit) < LL - 2) DO
          IF (c >= 32) & (c < 127) THEN
            i := Len(edit); WHILE i >= ecur DO edit[i + 1] := edit[i]; DEC(i) END; edit[ecur] := CHR(c); INC(ecur)
          END;
          c := Fisier.Citeste(h)
        END;
        Fisier.Gata(h); Fisier.Sterge("clip-in.txt"); pasteT := 0
      ELSIF Ceas.Ms() - pasteT > 3000 THEN pasteT := 0
      END
    END
  END PollPaste;

  (* ---------- sending a form ---------- *)

  PROCEDURE Enc(VAR q, s: ARRAY OF CHAR);   (* s, the way a form sends it, onto the end of q *)
    VAR i, c: INTEGER; hexd: ARRAY 17 OF CHAR;
  BEGIN
    hexd := "0123456789ABCDEF"; i := 0;
    WHILE (i < LEN(s)) & (s[i] # 0X) DO
      c := ORD(s[i]) MOD 256;
      IF IsAlnum(c) OR (c = ORD("-")) OR (c = ORD("_")) OR (c = ORD(".")) OR (c = ORD("*")) THEN AddC(q, s[i])
      ELSIF c = 32 THEN AddC(q, "+")
      ELSE AddC(q, "%"); AddC(q, hexd[c DIV 16]); AddC(q, hexd[c MOD 16])
      END;
      INC(i)
    END
  END Enc;

  PROCEDURE Pair(VAR q, n, v: ARRAY OF CHAR);   (* &name=value; a field with no name is not sent *)
  BEGIN
    IF n[0] # 0X THEN IF q[0] # 0X THEN AddC(q, "&") END; Enc(q, n); AddC(q, "="); Enc(q, v) END
  END Pair;

  PROCEDURE Writable(fo: INTEGER): INTEGER;   (* how many fields to write in form fo has *)
    VAR f, n: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    n := 0;
    FOR f := 0 TO nf - 1 DO
      IF (fForm[f] = fo) & ((fKind[f] = fkText) OR (fKind[f] = fkPass) OR (fKind[f] = fkArea)) THEN INC(n) END
    END
    RETURN n
  END Writable;

  PROCEDURE FirstButton(fo: INTEGER): INTEGER;   (* the button ENTER presses; -1 *)
    VAR f, r: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    r := -1; f := 0;
    WHILE (r < 0) & (f < nf) DO IF (fForm[f] = fo) & (fKind[f] = fkSubmit) THEN r := f END; INC(f) END
    RETURN r
  END FirstButton;

  PROCEDURE SendForm(fo, btn: INTEGER);   (* form fo, sent with button btn (-1 = none) *)
    VAR q: ARRAY 8000 OF CHAR; u: ARRAY LL OF CHAR; on: ARRAY 4 OF CHAR; f, k, i: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    q[0] := 0X; on := "on";
    FOR f := 0 TO nf - 1 DO
      IF fForm[f] = fo THEN
        k := fKind[f];
        IF (k = fkHidden) OR (k = fkText) OR (k = fkPass) OR (k = fkArea) THEN Pair(q, fName[f], fVal[f])
        ELSIF (k = fkCheck) OR (k = fkRadio) THEN
          IF fOn[f] THEN IF fVal[f][0] # 0X THEN Pair(q, fName[f], fVal[f]) ELSE Pair(q, fName[f], on) END END
        ELSIF k = fkSelect THEN
          IF fNOpt[f] > 0 THEN Pair(q, fName[f], oVal[fOpt0[f] + fSel[f]]) END
        ELSIF (k = fkSubmit) & (f = btn) THEN Pair(q, fName[f], fVal[f])
        END
      END
    END;
    Copy(frAct[fo], u);
    IF frPost[fo] THEN Say("SENDING"); PostGo(u, q)
    ELSE
      i := Find(u, "#", 0); IF i > 0 THEN u[i] := 0X END;
      i := Find(u, "?", 0); IF i > 0 THEN u[i] := 0X END;
      AddC(u, "?"); Add(u, q);
      IF Len(u) >= LL - 1 THEN Say("THE FORM IS TOO LONG FOR AN ADDRESS") ELSE Go(u, TRUE) END
    END
  END SendForm;

  PROCEDURE FieldTap(f: INTEGER);   (* a finger on field f *)
    VAR i, k: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    k := fKind[f];
    IF (k = fkText) OR (k = fkPass) OR (k = fkArea) THEN
      editing := TRUE; kdown := FALSE; Keys1.Reset; ef := f; Copy(fVal[f], edit); ecur := Len(edit)
    ELSIF k = fkCheck THEN fOn[f] := ~fOn[f]
    ELSIF k = fkRadio THEN
      FOR i := 0 TO nf - 1 DO
        IF (fKind[i] = fkRadio) & (fForm[i] = fForm[f]) & Same(fName[i], fName[f]) THEN fOn[i] := FALSE END
      END;
      fOn[f] := TRUE
    ELSIF k = fkSelect THEN IF fNOpt[f] > 0 THEN fSel[f] := (fSel[f] + 1) MOD fNOpt[f] END
    ELSIF k = fkSubmit THEN SendForm(fForm[f], f)
    END
  END FieldTap;

  (* ---------- the screens ---------- *)

  PROCEDURE Star(cx, cy, c: INTEGER);   (* a five-pointed star, the way OllGL6 turns its triangles *)
    VAR ox, oy, ix, iy: ARRAY 5 OF INTEGER; k, j, n: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    ox[0] := 0; oy[0] := -18; ox[1] := 17; oy[1] := -6; ox[2] := 11; oy[2] := 15; ox[3] := -11; oy[3] := 15; ox[4] := -17; oy[4] := -6;
    ix[0] := 4; iy[0] := -6; ix[1] := 7; iy[1] := 2; ix[2] := 0; iy[2] := 7; ix[3] := -7; iy[3] := 2; ix[4] := -4; iy[4] := -6;
    FOR k := 0 TO 4 DO
      j := (k + 4) MOD 5; n := (k + 1) MOD 5;
      OllGL6.Triunghi2D(cx + ox[k], cy + oy[k], cx + ix[k], cy + iy[k], cx + ix[j], cy + iy[j], c);
      OllGL6.Triunghi2D(cx, cy, cx + ix[k], cy + iy[k], cx + ix[n], cy + iy[n], c)
    END
  END Star;

  PROCEDURE Stars(VAR v, s: ARRAY OF CHAR);   (* a password as stars *)
    VAR n: INTEGER;
  BEGIN s[0] := 0X; n := Len(v); WHILE n > 0 DO AddC(s, "*"); DEC(n) END
  END Stars;

  PROCEDURE DrawField(i, yy, m: INTEGER);   (* word i is a field of a form *)
    VAR f, k, x, w, sz, c: INTEGER; s: ARRAY LL OF CHAR;
  BEGIN
    f := wF[i]; k := fKind[f]; x := wX[i]; w := wL[i] * 6 * m;
    IF (k = fkText) OR (k = fkPass) OR (k = fkArea) THEN
      OllGL6.Rotund2D(x - 7, yy - 2 * m - 3, w + 10, 11 * m + 6, 7, Desk6.muted);
      OllGL6.Rotund2D(x - 5, yy - 2 * m - 1, w + 6, 11 * m + 2, 6, Desk6.surface);
      IF fVal[f][0] = 0X THEN Copy(fLabel[f], s); c := Desk6.muted
      ELSIF k = fkPass THEN Stars(fVal[f], s); c := Desk6.text
      ELSE ShowVal(fVal[f], s); c := Desk6.text
      END;
      IF Len(s) > wL[i] - 1 THEN s[wL[i] - 1] := 0X END;
      Say2(x, yy, s, m, c)
    ELSIF (k = fkCheck) OR (k = fkRadio) THEN
      sz := 7 * m + 4;
      IF k = fkRadio THEN
        OllGL6.Cerc2D(x + sz DIV 2, yy + 3 * m, sz DIV 2 + 2, Desk6.muted);
        OllGL6.Cerc2D(x + sz DIV 2, yy + 3 * m, sz DIV 2, Desk6.surface);
        IF fOn[f] THEN OllGL6.Cerc2D(x + sz DIV 2, yy + 3 * m, sz DIV 4, gold) END
      ELSE
        OllGL6.Rotund2D(x - 2, yy - m - 2, sz + 4, sz + 4, 5, Desk6.muted);
        OllGL6.Rotund2D(x, yy - m, sz, sz, 4, Desk6.surface);
        IF fOn[f] THEN OllGL6.Rotund2D(x + sz DIV 4, yy - m + sz DIV 4, sz DIV 2, sz DIV 2, 2, gold) END
      END
    ELSIF k = fkSelect THEN
      OllGL6.Rotund2D(x - 5, yy - 2 * m - 1, w + 6, 11 * m + 2, 6, Desk6.surface);
      IF fNOpt[f] > 0 THEN Copy(oText[fOpt0[f] + fSel[f]], s) ELSE s[0] := 0X END;
      IF Len(s) > wL[i] - 3 THEN s[wL[i] - 3] := 0X END;
      Say2(x, yy, s, m, Desk6.text);
      OllGL6.Triunghi2D(x + w - 5 * m, yy + 2 * m, x + w - m, yy + 2 * m, x + w - 3 * m, yy + 5 * m, linkc)
    ELSIF k = fkSubmit THEN
      OllGL6.Rotund2D(x - 5, yy - 2 * m - 1, w + 6, 11 * m + 2, 6, gold);
      Say2(x + 5 * m, yy, fLabel[f], m, bgk)
    END
  END DrawField;

  PROCEDURE Cells(VAR pix: ARRAY OF INTEGER; b, cwn, chn, x, y, dw, dh: INTEGER);   (* squares -> rectangles of one colour *)
    VAR cx, cy, n, y0, y1, x0, x1, c: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    cy := 0;
    WHILE (cy < chn) & (OllGL6.Liber2D() > 1200) DO
      y0 := y + cy * dh DIV chn; y1 := y + (cy + 1) * dh DIV chn;
      IF (y1 > y0) & (y1 > TOP) & (y0 < H - 84) THEN
        cx := 0;
        WHILE cx < cwn DO   (* squares of one colour side by side are one rectangle *)
          c := pix[b + cy * cwn + cx]; n := cx + 1;
          WHILE (n < cwn) & (pix[b + cy * cwn + n] = c) DO INC(n) END;
          x0 := x + cx * dw DIV cwn; x1 := x + n * dw DIV cwn;
          OllGL6.Dreptunghi2D(x0, y0, x1 - x0, y1 - y0, OllGL6.RGB(c DIV 65536, c DIV 256 MOD 256, c MOD 256));
          cx := n
        END
      END;
      INC(cy)
    END
  END Cells;

  PROCEDURE DrawImg(i, yy: INTEGER);   (* word i is a picture; yy its top *)
    VAR s, dw, dh, x: INTEGER; t: ARRAY 120 OF CHAR;
  BEGIN
    s := wS[i]; ImgSize(s, dw, dh); x := wX[i];
    IF iSt[s] = 3 THEN
      IF iTex[s] THEN OllGL7.Poza2D(x, yy, dw, dh, s) ELSE Cells(iPix, s * CELLS, iCw[s], iCh[s], x, yy, dw, dh) END;
      IF wA[i] >= 0 THEN OllGL6.Dreptunghi2D(x, yy + dh + 2, dw, 2, linkc) END   (* a picture that is a link *)
    ELSIF iSt[s] = 4 THEN
      t := "["; Add(t, iWhy[s]); Add(t, "] "); Add(t, iAlt[s]); Short(t, (W - 2 * MX) DIV (6 * ts));
      Say2(x, yy + 2 * ts, t, ts, Desk6.muted)
    ELSE
      OllGL6.Rotund2D(x, yy, dw, dh, 6, Desk6.surface);
      IF dh >= 9 * ts THEN Say2(x + 10, yy + (dh - 7 * ts) DIV 2, "...", ts, Desk6.muted) END
    END
  END DrawImg;

  (* ---------- find in page ---------- *)

  PROCEDURE Fold(c: CHAR): CHAR;   (* small letters, and the Romanian ones as their plain letter *)
    VAR k: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    k := ORD(c);
    IF (c >= "A") & (c <= "Z") THEN c := CHR(k + 32)
    ELSIF (k = 128) OR (k = 129) OR (k = 133) OR (k = 134) THEN c := "a"
    ELSIF (k = 130) OR (k = 135) THEN c := "i"
    ELSIF (k = 131) OR (k = 136) THEN c := "s"
    ELSIF (k = 132) OR (k = 137) THEN c := "t"
    END
    RETURN c
  END Fold;

  PROCEDURE Has(i, qs, ql: INTEGER): BOOLEAN;   (* word i holds the letters fq[qs .. qs+ql-1] *)
    VAR p, k: INTEGER; ok: BOOLEAN;
  BEGIN
    ok := FALSE;
    IF (wK[i] < kField) & (wL[i] >= ql) THEN
      p := 0;
      WHILE ~ok & (p <= wL[i] - ql) DO
        k := 0; WHILE (k < ql) & (Fold(pool[wS[i] + p + k]) = Fold(fq[qs + k])) DO INC(k) END;
        ok := k = ql; INC(p)
      END
    END
    RETURN ok
  END Has;

  PROCEDURE JumpHit;   (* the place found now, a third down the screen *)
    VAR r, w: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    IF nHit > 0 THEN
      w := fHit[curHit]; r := 0;
      WHILE (r < nr) & ~((rW0[r] <= w) & (w < rW1[r])) DO INC(r) END;
      IF r < nr THEN scroll := (H - 84 - TOP) DIV 3 - rY[r] END
    END
  END JumpHit;

  PROCEDURE DoFind;   (* fq: one word, or several one after the other *)
    VAR qs, ql: ARRAY 8 OF INTEGER; n, i, k, j: INTEGER; ok: BOOLEAN;
  BEGIN
    ClearHits; n := 0; i := 0;
    WHILE (fq[i] # 0X) & (n < 8) DO
      WHILE fq[i] = " " DO INC(i) END;
      IF fq[i] # 0X THEN
        qs[n] := i; WHILE (fq[i] # 0X) & (fq[i] # " ") DO INC(i) END; ql[n] := i - qs[n]; INC(n)
      END
    END;
    IF n > 0 THEN
      fWords := n; i := 0;
      WHILE (i <= nw - n) & (nHit < NHIT) DO
        ok := wK[i] < kPara; k := 0; j := i;
        WHILE ok & (k < n) DO
          WHILE (j < nw) & (wK[j] >= kPara) DO INC(j) END;   (* a line ends between two words: still one after the other *)
          IF (j < nw) & Has(j, qs[k], ql[k]) THEN INC(j); INC(k) ELSE ok := FALSE END
        END;
        IF ok THEN
          fHit[nHit] := i; INC(nHit); j := i; k := 0;
          WHILE (k < n) & (j < nw) DO IF wK[j] < kPara THEN wHit[j] := TRUE; INC(k) END; INC(j) END
        END;
        INC(i)
      END;
      IF nHit > 0 THEN finding := TRUE; curHit := 0; JumpHit ELSE Say("NOT IN THIS PAGE") END
    END
  END DoFind;

  PROCEDURE PlayMark(cx, cy, r: INTEGER);   (* a round PLAY *)
  BEGIN
    OllGL6.Cerc2D(cx, cy, r + 3, white); OllGL6.Cerc2D(cx, cy, r, panel);
    OllGL6.Triunghi2D(cx - r DIV 3, cy - r DIV 2, cx + r * 3 DIV 5, cy, cx - r DIV 3, cy + r DIV 2, white)
  END PlayMark;

  PROCEDURE DrawVid(i, yy: INTEGER);   (* word i is a film; yy its top *)
    VAR k, s, dw, dh, x: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    k := wS[i]; s := mdPost[k]; BoxSize(i, dw, dh); x := wX[i];
    IF (s >= 0) & (iSt[s] = 3) & (dh >= 60) THEN
      IF iTex[s] THEN OllGL7.Poza2D(x, yy, dw, dh, s) ELSE Cells(iPix, s * CELLS, iCw[s], iCh[s], x, yy, dw, dh) END;
      PlayMark(x + dw DIV 2, yy + dh DIV 2, 26)
    ELSE
      OllGL6.Rotund2D(x, yy, dw, dh, 14, Desk6.surface); PlayMark(x + 30, yy + dh DIV 2, 18);
      IF mdAud[k] THEN Say2(x + 62, yy + dh DIV 2 - 3 * ts, "SOUND", ts, Desk6.text)
      ELSE Say2(x + 62, yy + dh DIV 2 - 3 * ts, "FILM", ts, Desk6.text)
      END
    END
  END DrawVid;

  PROCEDURE Draw;
    VAR r, i, yy, m, c, vh, bh, by: INTEGER; s: ARRAY 160 OF CHAR;
  BEGIN
    OllGL6.Incepe(Desk6.bg);
    r := 0;
    WHILE (r < nr) & (OllGL6.Liber2D() > 3000) DO
      yy := TOP + scroll + rY[r]; m := rM[r];
      IF (yy + rHt[r] > TOP - 2 * m) & (yy - 2 * m < H - 84) THEN
        FOR i := rW0[r] TO rW1[r] - 1 DO
          IF wK[i] < kPara THEN
            IF (i = hw) & down & ~moved & (wK[i] # kImg) & (wK[i] # kVid) THEN OllGL6.Rotund2D(wX[i] - 10, yy - 2 * m - 5, wL[i] * 6 * m + 18, 11 * m + 10, 8, press) END;
            IF wHit[i] THEN
              IF (nHit > 0) & (i >= fHit[curHit]) & (i < fHit[curHit] + fWords + 2) THEN c := hitNow ELSE c := hitOld END;
              OllGL6.Rotund2D(wX[i] - 4, yy - 2 * m - 2, wL[i] * 6 * m + 6, 11 * m + 4, 4, c)
            END;
            IF wK[i] = kImg THEN DrawImg(i, yy)
            ELSIF wK[i] = kVid THEN DrawVid(i, yy)
            ELSIF wK[i] = kField THEN DrawField(i, yy, m)
            ELSE
              Piece(i, s);
              IF wA[i] >= 0 THEN c := linkc ELSIF wK[i] = kSub THEN c := Desk6.Accent() ELSE c := Desk6.text END;
              Say2(wX[i], yy, s, m, c);
              IF wA[i] >= 0 THEN OllGL6.Dreptunghi2D(wX[i], yy + 9 * m, wL[i] * 6 * m - m, 2, linkc) END
            END
          END
        END
      END;
      INC(r)
    END;
    vh := H - 84 - TOP;   (* how far down you are *)
    IF totalH > vh THEN
      bh := vh * vh DIV totalH; IF bh < 30 THEN bh := 30 END;
      by := TOP + (-scroll) * (vh - bh) DIV (totalH - vh);
      OllGL6.Rotund2D(W - 8, by, 5, bh, 2, Desk6.muted)
    END;
    (* the top: title, the star, A- A+, the address bar *)
    OllGL6.Dreptunghi2D(0, 0, W, TOP - 4, Desk6.bg);
    Desk6.Header("", "");
    Say2(24, 54, name, 4, Desk6.text);   (* her name alone again: size 4 fits next to the star *)
    IF priv THEN i := gold ELSE i := Desk6.muted END;
    OllGL6.Rotund2D(156, 48, 52, 44, 10, i); OllGL6.Rotund2D(159, 51, 46, 38, 8, panel);   (* the tabs (gold: private) *)
    s := ""; PutNum(s, ntab); Desk6.Centre(182, 60, s, 3, Desk6.text);
    OllGL6.Rotund2D(W - 324, 48, 92, 44, 22, panel);
    IF (curSlot >= 0) & (MarkOf(url) >= 0) THEN Star(W - 278, 71, gold) ELSE Star(W - 278, 71, Desk6.muted) END;
    OllGL6.Rotund2D(W - 220, 48, 92, 44, 22, panel); Say2(W - 196, 60, "A-", 3, Desk6.text);
    OllGL6.Rotund2D(W - 116, 48, 92, 44, 22, panel); Say2(W - 92, 60, "A+", 3, Desk6.text);
    OllGL6.Rotund2D(16, 104, W - 32, 54, 27, Desk6.surface);
    OllGL6.Cerc2D(46, 131, 9, linkc); OllGL6.Cerc2D(46, 131, 5, Desk6.surface);
    Shown(s); Short(s, (W - 100) DIV 12);
    IF state # idle THEN
      Say2(68, 124, s, 2, Desk6.muted);
      i := Ceas.Ms() DIV 4 MOD (W - 80); OllGL6.Rotund2D(40 + i, 150, 40, 4, 2, Desk6.Accent())
    ELSE Say2(68, 124, s, 2, Desk6.text)
    END;
    (* the bottom *)
    OllGL6.Dreptunghi2D(0, H - 80, W, 160, Desk6.dark);
    OllGL6.Rotund2D(W DIV 6 - 64, H - 62, 128, 44, 22, panel); Desk6.Centre(W DIV 6, H - 46, "BACK", 2, Desk6.text);
    OllGL6.Rotund2D(W DIV 2 - 64, H - 62, 128, 44, 22, panel);
    IF alone THEN Desk6.Centre(W DIV 2, H - 46, "HISTORY", 2, Desk6.text) ELSE Desk6.Centre(W DIV 2, H - 46, "HOME", 2, Desk6.text) END;
    OllGL6.Rotund2D(5 * W DIV 6 - 64, H - 62, 128, 44, 22, panel); Desk6.Centre(5 * W DIV 6, H - 46, "START", 2, Desk6.text);
    IF finding THEN   (* 3 / 17   <  >  X *)
      OllGL6.Rotund2D(16, H - 140, W - 32, 48, 24, panel);
      s := ""; PutNum(s, curHit + 1); Add(s, " / "); PutNum(s, nHit); Add(s, "  "); Add(s, fq); Short(s, (W - 260) DIV 12);
      Say2(36, H - 124, s, 2, Desk6.text);
      Say2(W - 196, H - 128, "<", 3, gold); Say2(W - 126, H - 128, ">", 3, gold); Say2(W - 56, H - 128, "x", 3, red)
    END;
    IF tMsg > 0 THEN
      DEC(tMsg); i := H - 140; IF finding THEN i := H - 196 END;
      OllGL6.Rotund2D(40, i, W - 80, 44, 22, panel); Desk6.Centre(W DIV 2, i + 16, msg, 2, Desk6.Accent())
    END;
    IF menuOn THEN   (* a link held: what to do with it *)
      OllGL6.Rotund2D(12, H - 250, W - 24, 160, 24, Desk6.dark); OllGL6.Rotund2D(14, H - 248, W - 28, 156, 22, Desk6.surface);
      Copy(menuUrl, s); i := Find(s, "://", 0); IF (i > 0) & (i < 10) THEN Cut(s, 0, i + 3) END; Short(s, (W - 64) DIV 12);
      Say2(32, H - 228, s, 2, Desk6.muted);
      FOR i := 0 TO 3 DO OllGL6.Rotund2D((2 * i + 1) * W DIV 8 - 60, H - 176, 120, 56, 28, panel) END;
      IF menuKind = 1 THEN Desk6.Centre(W DIV 8, H - 156, "NEW TAB", 2, Desk6.Accent())
      ELSE Desk6.Centre(W DIV 8, H - 156, "SAVE", 2, Desk6.Accent())
      END;
      Desk6.Centre(3 * W DIV 8, H - 156, "COPY", 2, Desk6.text); Desk6.Centre(5 * W DIV 8, H - 156, "SHARE", 2, Desk6.text);
      IF menuKind = 1 THEN Desk6.Centre(7 * W DIV 8, H - 156, "PRIVATE", 2, gold)
      ELSIF desk THEN Desk6.Centre(7 * W DIV 8, H - 156, "PHONE", 2, Desk6.text)
      ELSE Desk6.Centre(7 * W DIV 8, H - 156, "COMPUTER", 2, Desk6.text)
      END
    END;
    OllGL6.Arata
  END Draw;

  PROCEDURE EditFrame(isDown: BOOLEAN; x, y: INTEGER);   (* the address bar or a field, with the keyboard (pixels, like the editor) *)
    VAR k, i, cols, st, top, f: INTEGER; hit: BOOLEAN; s, v: ARRAY LL OF CHAR;
  BEGIN
    hit := ~isDown & kdown; kdown := isDown;
    Grafica.Dreptunghi(0, 0, W, H, bgk);
    Copy(name, s); IF ef >= 0 THEN Add(s, " . write") ELSE Add(s, " . where to?") END; SayPx(24, 54, s, 3, white);
    Grafica.Dreptunghi(W - 70, 40, 54, 50, panel); Grafica.Text(W - 52, 56, "X", 3, red);
    Grafica.Dreptunghi(16, 110, W - 32, 60, panel);
    cols := (W - 64) DIV 12; st := 0; IF ecur > cols - 1 THEN st := ecur - cols + 1 END;
    IF (ef >= 0) & (fKind[ef] = fkPass) THEN Stars(edit, v) ELSE Copy(edit, v) END;
    i := 0; WHILE (v[st + i] # 0X) & (i < cols) DO s[i] := v[st + i]; INC(i) END; s[i] := 0X;
    SayPx(32, 130, s, 2, white);
    Grafica.Dreptunghi(31 + (ecur - st) * 12, 122, 3, 36, gold);
    IF ef >= 0 THEN
      IF fLabel[ef][0] # 0X THEN Copy(fLabel[ef], s); Short(s, (W - 48) DIV 12); SayPx(24, 196, s, 2, muted) END;
      IF Writable(fForm[ef]) = 1 THEN SayPx(24, 228, "ENTER sends the form", 2, muted)
      ELSE SayPx(24, 228, "ENTER or X keeps it; then the button", 2, muted)
      END
    ELSE
      SayPx(24, 196, "an address: wikipedia.org", 2, muted);
      SayPx(24, 228, "or a few words: Marginalia", 2, muted);
      SayPx(24, 260, "w and words: Wikipedia", 2, muted)
    END;
    Grafica.Dreptunghi(24, 300, 150, 50, panel); Grafica.Dreptunghi(190, 300, 150, 50, panel); Grafica.Dreptunghi(356, 300, 150, 50, panel);
    IF pasteT # 0 THEN SayPx(81, 316, "...", 2, gold) ELSE SayPx(69, 316, "PASTE", 2, white) END;
    SayPx(241, 316, "COPY", 2, white); SayPx(401, 316, "CLEAR", 2, white);
    IF ef < 0 THEN Grafica.Dreptunghi(24, 362, 482, 50, panel); SayPx(185, 378, "FIND IN PAGE", 2, white) END;
    IF tMsg > 0 THEN DEC(tMsg); SayPx(24, 432, msg, 2, gold) END;
    PollPaste;
    top := H - Keys1.Height - 10;
    k := Keys1.Draw(top, isDown, hit, x, y);
    IF hit & (ef < 0) & (y >= 358) & (y < 416) & (x >= 20) & (x < 510) THEN   (* FIND IN PAGE *)
      Copy(edit, fq); editing := FALSE; down := TRUE; moved := TRUE; DoFind
    ELSIF hit & (y >= 296) & (y < 354) & (x >= 20) & (x < 510) THEN   (* PASTE COPY CLEAR *)
      IF x < 182 THEN AskPaste
      ELSIF x < 348 THEN CopyOut(edit); Say("COPIED")
      ELSE edit[0] := 0X; ecur := 0
      END
    ELSIF hit & (y < 100) & (x >= W - 80) THEN
      IF ef >= 0 THEN Copy(edit, fVal[ef]); ef := -1 END;   (* a field keeps what you wrote; the address bar forgets it *)
      editing := FALSE; down := TRUE; moved := TRUE
    ELSIF k = 13 THEN
      editing := FALSE; down := TRUE; moved := TRUE;
      IF ef >= 0 THEN
        Copy(edit, fVal[ef]); f := ef; ef := -1;
        IF Writable(fForm[f]) = 1 THEN SendForm(fForm[f], FirstButton(fForm[f])) END
      ELSE Submit
      END
    ELSIF k = 8 THEN IF ecur > 0 THEN Cut(edit, ecur - 1, 1); DEC(ecur) END
    ELSIF k = Keys1.LEFT THEN IF ecur > 0 THEN DEC(ecur) END
    ELSIF k = Keys1.RIGHT THEN IF ecur < Len(edit) THEN INC(ecur) END
    ELSIF (k >= 32) & (k < 127) & (Len(edit) < LL - 2) THEN
      i := Len(edit); WHILE i >= ecur DO edit[i + 1] := edit[i]; DEC(i) END; edit[ecur] := CHR(k); INC(ecur)
    END;
    Ecran.Arata
  END EditFrame;

  (* ---------- the films: the player of the window ---------- *)

  PROCEDURE VidCmd(s: ARRAY OF CHAR);   (* vid.txt + vid-go: play, pause, resume, seek, hide *)
    VAR h: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    h := Fisier.Creeaza("vid.txt");
    IF h >= 0 THEN Put(h, s); Fisier.Scrie(h, 10); Fisier.Gata(h); Signal("vid-go") END
  END VidCmd;

  PROCEDURE PlayMedia(VAR u: ARRAY OF CHAR; aud: BOOLEAN);
    VAR s: ARRAY LL + 80 OF CHAR;
  BEGIN
    IF ~Gazda4.Hosted() THEN Say("NO HOST, NO FILM")
    ELSE
      playing := TRUE; Copy(u, plUrl); plAud := aud; plSt := 1; plPos := 0; plDur := 0;
      tPl := 0; tPlStart := Ceas.Ms(); down := TRUE; moved := TRUE;
      Copy("play ", s); Add(s, u); AddC(s, " ");
      IF aud THEN Add(s, "0 "); PutNum(s, TOP); Add(s, " 2 2 ")   (* a sound: the player is a dot *)
      ELSE Add(s, "0 "); PutNum(s, TOP + 60); AddC(s, " "); PutNum(s, W); AddC(s, " "); PutNum(s, H - TOP - 60 - 220); AddC(s, " ")
      END;
      PutNum(s, W); AddC(s, " "); PutNum(s, H);
      VidCmd(s)
    END
  END PlayMedia;

  PROCEDURE PollFilm;   (* vid-st.txt: "STATE POSITION LENGTH" (1 playing, 2 paused, 3 ended, 4 cannot) *)
    VAR h, now: INTEGER; line: ARRAY 80 OF CHAR; w: ARRAY 24 OF CHAR;
  BEGIN
    now := Ceas.Ms();
    IF now - tPl >= 250 THEN
      tPl := now; h := Fisier.Deschide("vid-st.txt");
      IF h >= 0 THEN
        ReadLine(h, line); Fisier.Gata(h);
        IF now - tPlStart > 600 THEN   (* what the player said before this film does not count *)
          Word(line, 0, w); plSt := Num(w); Word(line, 1, w); plPos := Num(w); Word(line, 2, w); plDur := Num(w)
        END
      END
    END
  END PollFilm;

  PROCEDURE Clock(VAR s: ARRAY OF CHAR; ms: INTEGER);   (* m:ss at the end of s *)
    VAR sec: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    sec := ms DIV 1000; PutNum(s, sec DIV 60); AddC(s, ":");
    IF sec MOD 60 < 10 THEN AddC(s, "0") END; PutNum(s, sec MOD 60)
  END Clock;

  PROCEDURE PlayerFrame(isDown: BOOLEAN; x, y: INTEGER);
    VAR t: ARRAY LL OF CHAR; i, by, bw: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    PollFilm; Poll;
    IF (plSt = 4) & (fallWeb[0] # 0X) THEN   (* her player cannot: the film's own page in the window into the whole web *)
      VidCmd("hide"); playing := FALSE; Copy(fallWeb, t); fallWeb[0] := 0X; WebOpen(t)
    END;
    by := H - 150; bw := W - 48;
    IF isDown & ~down THEN down := TRUE; moved := FALSE; x0 := x; y0 := y
    ELSIF isDown THEN IF (ABS(y - y0) > 14) OR (ABS(x - x0) > 14) THEN moved := TRUE END
    ELSIF down THEN
      down := FALSE;
      IF ~moved & (y0 >= H - 84) THEN
        IF x0 < W DIV 3 THEN VidCmd("hide"); playing := FALSE; fallWeb[0] := 0X; down := TRUE; moved := TRUE   (* CLOSE *)
        ELSIF x0 < 2 * W DIV 3 THEN
          IF plSt = 1 THEN VidCmd("pause"); plSt := 2 ELSE VidCmd("resume"); plSt := 1 END
        END
      ELSIF ~moved & (y0 >= by - 30) & (y0 < by + 40) & (plDur > 0) THEN   (* the line of the film *)
        Copy("seek ", t); i := x0 - 24; IF i < 0 THEN i := 0 ELSIF i > bw THEN i := bw END;
        PutNum(t, plDur DIV bw * i); VidCmd(t)
      END
    END;
    IF playing THEN
      OllGL6.Incepe(OllGL6.RGB(0, 0, 0));
      OllGL6.Dreptunghi2D(0, 0, W, TOP + 56, Desk6.bg);
      Desk6.Header("", "");
      Say2(24, 54, name, 4, Desk6.text);
      Copy(plUrl, t); i := Find(t, "://", 0); IF (i > 0) & (i < 10) THEN Cut(t, 0, i + 3) END;
      Short(t, (W - 48) DIV 12); Say2(24, 112, t, 2, Desk6.muted);
      IF plSt = 4 THEN
        Say2(24, TOP + 120, "This one cannot play here.", 2, Desk6.text);
        Say2(24, TOP + 150, "Android has no Ogg Theora, and some", 2, Desk6.muted);
        Say2(24, TOP + 176, "sites do not give their films away.", 2, Desk6.muted)
      ELSIF (plSt = 1) & (plDur <= 0) THEN Say2(24, TOP + 120, "coming...", 2, Desk6.muted)
      ELSIF plAud THEN Say2(24, TOP + 120, "a sound", 2, Desk6.muted)
      END;
      (* the line of the film *)
      OllGL6.Dreptunghi2D(0, by - 40, W, H, Desk6.bg);
      OllGL6.Rotund2D(24, by, bw, 8, 4, Desk6.surface);
      IF plDur > 0 THEN
        i := bw * (plPos DIV 100) DIV (plDur DIV 100 + 1);
        OllGL6.Rotund2D(24, by, i, 8, 4, gold); OllGL6.Cerc2D(24 + i, by + 4, 12, white)
      END;
      t := ""; Clock(t, plPos); Add(t, " / "); Clock(t, plDur);
      IF plSt = 3 THEN Add(t, "  the end") END;
      Say2(24, by - 32, t, 2, Desk6.muted);
      OllGL6.Dreptunghi2D(0, H - 80, W, 160, Desk6.dark);
      OllGL6.Rotund2D(W DIV 6 - 64, H - 62, 128, 44, 22, panel); Desk6.Centre(W DIV 6, H - 46, "CLOSE", 2, Desk6.text);
      OllGL6.Rotund2D(W DIV 2 - 64, H - 62, 128, 44, 22, panel);
      IF plSt = 1 THEN Desk6.Centre(W DIV 2, H - 46, "PAUSE", 2, Desk6.text) ELSE Desk6.Centre(W DIV 2, H - 46, "PLAY", 2, Desk6.text) END;
      OllGL6.Arata
    ELSE Draw
    END
  END PlayerFrame;

  (* ---------- a picture seen big ---------- *)

  PROCEDURE OpenView(i: INTEGER);
  BEGIN
    viewing := TRUE; vSlot := wS[i]; vLink := wA[i]; vSt := 1; vCw := 0; vCh := 0;
    down := TRUE; moved := TRUE   (* the finger that opened it does not press anything *)
  END OpenView;

  PROCEDURE ViewFrame(isDown: BOOLEAN; x, y: INTEGER);
    VAR aw, ah, dw, dh, w0, h0, px, py, s: INTEGER; t, u: ARRAY LL OF CHAR;
  BEGIN
    Poll; s := vSlot;
    IF isDown & ~down THEN down := TRUE; moved := FALSE; x0 := x; y0 := y
    ELSIF isDown THEN IF (ABS(y - y0) > 14) OR (ABS(x - x0) > 14) THEN moved := TRUE END
    ELSIF down THEN
      down := FALSE;
      IF ~moved & (y0 >= H - 84) THEN
        IF x0 < W DIV 3 THEN viewing := FALSE; down := TRUE; moved := TRUE   (* CLOSE *)
        ELSIF x0 < 2 * W DIV 3 THEN
          IF vLink >= 0 THEN viewing := FALSE; Copy(links[vLink], t); Go(t, TRUE) ELSE Say("THIS PICTURE IS NOT A LINK") END
        ELSE CopyOut(iUrl[s]); Say("PICTURE ADDRESS COPIED")
        END
      END
    END;
    IF viewing THEN
      OllGL6.Incepe(OllGL6.RGB(6, 2, 12));
      (* as big as fits between the top and the buttons *)
      aw := W - 16; ah := H - 84 - TOP - 16; w0 := iW[s]; h0 := iH[s];
      IF (w0 < 1) OR (h0 < 1) THEN w0 := 1; h0 := 1 END;
      dw := aw; dh := h0 * dw DIV w0;
      IF dh > ah THEN dh := ah; dw := w0 * dh DIV h0 END;
      px := (W - dw) DIV 2; py := TOP + (ah - dh) DIV 2 + 8;
      IF (vSt = 3) & vTex THEN OllGL7.Poza2D(px, py, dw, dh, BIGTEX)
      ELSIF (vSt = 3) & (vCw > 0) THEN Cells(vPix, 0, vCw, vCh, px, py, dw, dh)
      ELSIF iTex[s] THEN OllGL7.Poza2D(px, py, dw, dh, s)   (* the small one, until the big one comes *)
      ELSE Cells(iPix, s * CELLS, iCw[s], iCh[s], px, py, dw, dh)
      END;
      OllGL6.Dreptunghi2D(0, 0, W, TOP - 4, Desk6.bg);
      Desk6.Header("", "");
      Say2(24, 54, name, 4, Desk6.text);
      IF iAlt[s][0] # 0X THEN Copy(iAlt[s], t)
      ELSE Copy(iUrl[s], t); px := Find(t, "://", 0); IF (px > 0) & (px < 10) THEN Cut(t, 0, px + 3) END
      END;
      Short(t, (W - 48) DIV 12); Say2(24, 112, t, 2, Desk6.text);
      t := ""; PutNum(t, iW[s]); Add(t, " x "); PutNum(t, iH[s]);
      IF vSt = 3 THEN Add(t, " . big") ELSIF vSt = 4 THEN Add(t, " . the big one did not come") ELSE Add(t, " . coming...") END;
      Say2(24, 140, t, 2, Desk6.muted);
      OllGL6.Dreptunghi2D(0, H - 80, W, 160, Desk6.dark);
      OllGL6.Rotund2D(W DIV 6 - 64, H - 62, 128, 44, 22, panel); Desk6.Centre(W DIV 6, H - 46, "CLOSE", 2, Desk6.text);
      OllGL6.Rotund2D(W DIV 2 - 64, H - 62, 128, 44, 22, panel);
      IF vLink >= 0 THEN Desk6.Centre(W DIV 2, H - 46, "LINK", 2, Desk6.text) ELSE Desk6.Centre(W DIV 2, H - 46, "LINK", 2, Desk6.muted) END;
      OllGL6.Rotund2D(5 * W DIV 6 - 64, H - 62, 128, 44, 22, panel); Desk6.Centre(5 * W DIV 6, H - 46, "COPY", 2, Desk6.text);
      IF tMsg > 0 THEN
        DEC(tMsg); OllGL6.Rotund2D(40, H - 140, W - 80, 44, 22, panel); Desk6.Centre(W DIV 2, H - 124, msg, 2, Desk6.Accent())
      END;
      OllGL6.Arata
    ELSE Draw
    END
  END ViewFrame;

  PROCEDURE SavePage;   (* the page you see, kept on the phone *)
    VAR i, n, k, hi, ho, b: INTEGER; used: BOOLEAN; nm, sn: ARRAY 24 OF CHAR;
  BEGIN
    IF (curSlot < 0) OR Starts(url, "nora:") OR ~Kept(curSlot) THEN Say("THIS PAGE CANNOT BE SAVED")
    ELSE
      k := 0; WHILE (k < nsv) & ~Same(svU[k], url) DO INC(k) END;
      IF k < nsv THEN n := svN[k]
      ELSIF nsv >= NSV THEN n := -1; Say("20 SAVED PAGES AT MOST: REMOVE ONE")
      ELSE
        n := 0;
        REPEAT used := FALSE; FOR i := 0 TO nsv - 1 DO IF svN[i] = n THEN used := TRUE END END; IF used THEN INC(n) END UNTIL ~used;
        svN[nsv] := n; Copy(url, svU[nsv]); INC(nsv)
      END;
      IF n >= 0 THEN
        IF title[0] # 0X THEN Copy(title, svT[k]) ELSE Copy(url, svT[k]) END; svT[k][63] := 0X;
        SlotName(curSlot, sn); SvName(n, nm);
        hi := Fisier.Deschide(sn); ho := Fisier.Creeaza(nm);
        IF (hi >= 0) & (ho >= 0) THEN
          b := Fisier.Citeste(hi); WHILE b >= 0 DO Fisier.Scrie(ho, b); b := Fisier.Citeste(hi) END;
          StoreSaved; Say("SAVED: TO READ WITHOUT THE NET (START PAGE)")
        ELSE Say("COULD NOT SAVE IT")
        END;
        IF hi >= 0 THEN Fisier.Gata(hi) END; IF ho >= 0 THEN Fisier.Gata(ho) END
      END
    END
  END SavePage;

  (* ---------- the tabs ---------- *)

  PROCEDURE SaveTab;   (* the tab you are in -> its place *)
    VAR i, k: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    k := ctab;
    IF state = asking THEN INC(reqId); state := idle; posting := FALSE; resolving := FALSE END;   (* what was coming is left *)
    Copy(url, tUrl[k]); Copy(title, tTitle[k]); tSlot[k] := curSlot; tScroll[k] := scroll; tNh[k] := nh; tPriv[k] := priv;
    FOR i := 0 TO nh - 1 DO Copy(hist[i], tHist[k * NH + i]); tHistS[k * NH + i] := histS[i]; tHistY[k * NH + i] := histY[i] END
  END SaveTab;

  PROCEDURE ShowTab(k: INTEGER);   (* go to tab k: its page from the disk if it is kept there, else from the net *)
    VAR i, s: INTEGER; t: ARRAY LL OF CHAR; nm: ARRAY 16 OF CHAR;
  BEGIN
    ctab := k; nh := tNh[k]; priv := tPriv[k];
    FOR i := 0 TO nh - 1 DO Copy(tHist[k * NH + i], hist[i]); histS[i] := tHistS[k * NH + i]; histY[i] := tHistY[k * NH + i] END;
    Copy(tUrl[k], t); s := tSlot[k]; finding := FALSE; viewing := FALSE;
    IF (t[0] = 0X) OR Same(t, "nora:start") THEN Copy("nora:start", url); Copy(url, want); StartPage
    ELSIF Same(t, "nora:history") THEN Copy(t, url); Copy(t, want); HistoryPage
    ELSIF Same(t, "nora:films") THEN Copy(t, url); Copy(t, want); FilmsPage
    ELSIF (s >= 0) & Same(slotUrl[s], t) & Kept(s) THEN
      Copy(t, url); Copy(t, want); Copy(t, base); SlotName(s, nm); Parse(nm, ""); Layout; curSlot := s
    ELSE Copy(t, url); Go(t, FALSE)
    END;
    scroll := tScroll[k]
  END ShowTab;

  PROCEDURE NewTab(u: ARRAY OF CHAR; p: BOOLEAN);   (* "" = the start page; p: private *)
  BEGIN
    IF ntab >= MT THEN Say("8 TABS AT MOST: CLOSE ONE")
    ELSE
      SaveTab; ctab := ntab; INC(ntab); nh := 0; curSlot := -1; scroll := 0; finding := FALSE; priv := p; tPriv[ctab] := p;
      tUrl[ctab][0] := 0X; tTitle[ctab][0] := 0X; tSlot[ctab] := -1; tScroll[ctab] := 0; tNh[ctab] := 0;
      IF u[0] = 0X THEN Copy("nora:start", url); Copy(url, want); StartPage ELSE Go(u, FALSE) END;
      IF p THEN Say("A PRIVATE TAB: NO HISTORY") ELSE Say("A NEW TAB") END
    END
  END NewTab;

  PROCEDURE MoveTab(a, b: INTEGER);   (* the place of tab a -> the place of tab b *)
    VAR i: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    Copy(tUrl[a], tUrl[b]); Copy(tTitle[a], tTitle[b]); tSlot[b] := tSlot[a]; tScroll[b] := tScroll[a]; tNh[b] := tNh[a]; tPriv[b] := tPriv[a];
    FOR i := 0 TO tNh[a] - 1 DO Copy(tHist[a * NH + i], tHist[b * NH + i]); tHistS[b * NH + i] := tHistS[a * NH + i]; tHistY[b * NH + i] := tHistY[a * NH + i] END
  END MoveTab;

  PROCEDURE CloseTab(k: INTEGER);
    VAR i: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    SaveTab;
    IF ntab <= 1 THEN nh := 0; priv := FALSE; tPriv[0] := FALSE; Go("nora:start", FALSE); tUrl[0] := "nora:start"; tNh[0] := 0; tScroll[0] := 0
    ELSE
      FOR i := k TO ntab - 2 DO MoveTab(i + 1, i) END;
      DEC(ntab);
      IF ctab = k THEN IF k >= ntab THEN k := ntab - 1 END; ShowTab(k)
      ELSIF ctab > k THEN DEC(ctab)
      END
    END
  END CloseTab;

  PROCEDURE TabsFrame(isDown: BOOLEAN; x, y: INTEGER);   (* all the tabs: tap one, X closes it *)
    VAR i, yy, c: INTEGER; s: ARRAY LL OF CHAR;
  BEGIN
    Poll;
    IF isDown & ~down THEN down := TRUE; moved := FALSE; x0 := x; y0 := y
    ELSIF isDown THEN IF (ABS(y - y0) > 14) OR (ABS(x - x0) > 14) THEN moved := TRUE END
    ELSIF down THEN
      down := FALSE;
      IF ~moved THEN
        IF y0 >= H - 84 THEN
          tabsOn := FALSE; down := TRUE; moved := TRUE;
          IF x0 < W DIV 3 THEN NewTab("", FALSE) ELSIF x0 < 2 * W DIV 3 THEN NewTab("", TRUE) END   (* NEW, PRIVATE; BACK *)
        ELSIF (y0 >= TOP) & ((y0 - TOP) DIV 100 < ntab) THEN
          i := (y0 - TOP) DIV 100;
          IF x0 >= W - 100 THEN CloseTab(i)
          ELSE tabsOn := FALSE; down := TRUE; moved := TRUE; IF i # ctab THEN ShowTab(i) END
          END
        END
      END
    END;
    IF tabsOn THEN
      OllGL6.Incepe(Desk6.bg);
      Desk6.Header("", "");
      Say2(24, 54, "Tabs", 4, Desk6.text); s := ""; PutNum(s, ntab); Add(s, " / 8"); Say2(W - 150, 66, s, 2, Desk6.muted);
      FOR i := 0 TO ntab - 1 DO
        yy := TOP + i * 100;
        IF i = ctab THEN c := Desk6.Accent() ELSIF tPriv[i] THEN c := gold ELSE c := Desk6.muted END;
        OllGL6.Rotund2D(16, yy, W - 32, 88, 18, c); OllGL6.Rotund2D(19, yy + 3, W - 38, 82, 16, Desk6.surface);
        Copy(tTitle[i], s); IF s[0] = 0X THEN Copy(tUrl[i], s) END; Short(s, (W - 140) DIV 12);
        Say2(36, yy + 16, s, 2, Desk6.text);
        Copy(tUrl[i], s); c := Find(s, "://", 0); IF (c > 0) & (c < 10) THEN Cut(s, 0, c + 3) END; Short(s, (W - 140) DIV 12);
        Say2(36, yy + 52, s, 2, Desk6.muted);
        IF tPriv[i] THEN Say2(W - 190, yy + 52, "PRIVATE", 2, gold) END;
        Say2(W - 66, yy + 30, "X", 3, red)
      END;
      OllGL6.Dreptunghi2D(0, H - 80, W, 160, Desk6.dark);
      FOR i := 0 TO 2 DO OllGL6.Rotund2D((2 * i + 1) * W DIV 6 - 76, H - 62, 152, 44, 22, panel) END;
      Desk6.Centre(W DIV 6, H - 46, "NEW TAB", 2, Desk6.Accent()); Desk6.Centre(W DIV 2, H - 46, "PRIVATE", 2, gold);
      Desk6.Centre(5 * W DIV 6, H - 46, "BACK", 2, Desk6.text);
      OllGL6.Arata
    ELSE Draw
    END
  END TabsFrame;

  PROCEDURE MenuFrame(isDown: BOOLEAN; x, y: INTEGER);   (* a link held, or the address bar *)
    VAR i: INTEGER; t: ARRAY LL + 8 OF CHAR;
  BEGIN
    Poll;
    IF isDown & ~down THEN down := TRUE; moved := FALSE; x0 := x; y0 := y
    ELSIF isDown THEN IF (ABS(y - y0) > 14) OR (ABS(x - x0) > 14) THEN moved := TRUE END
    ELSIF down THEN
      down := FALSE;
      IF ~moved THEN
        menuOn := FALSE;
        IF (y0 >= H - 180) & (y0 < H - 112) THEN
          i := x0 * 4 DIV W;
          IF i = 0 THEN IF menuKind = 1 THEN NewTab(menuUrl, FALSE) ELSE SavePage END
          ELSIF i = 1 THEN CopyOut(menuUrl); Say("COPIED")
          ELSIF i = 2 THEN Copy("share ", t); Add(t, menuUrl); WebCmd(t)
          ELSIF menuKind = 1 THEN NewTab(menuUrl, TRUE)
          ELSE
            desk := ~desk; IF desk THEN WebCmd("desk 1"); Say("THE SITES AS ON A COMPUTER (WHOLE WEB)") ELSE WebCmd("desk 0"); Say("THE SITES AS ON A PHONE") END
          END
        END
      END
    END;
    Draw
  END MenuFrame;

  PROCEDURE IsTube(VAR u: ARRAY OF CHAR): BOOLEAN;   (* YouTube: NewPipe can play it *)
  BEGIN RETURN (Find(u, "youtube.com", 0) >= 0) OR (Find(u, "youtu.be", 0) >= 0)
  END IsTube;

  PROCEDURE PollWeb;   (* webv-st.txt: "SHOWN PROGRESS CANBACK", the address, the title *)
    VAR h, now: INTEGER; line: ARRAY LL OF CHAR; w: ARRAY 24 OF CHAR;
  BEGIN
    now := Ceas.Ms();
    IF now - tWeb >= 250 THEN
      tWeb := now; h := Fisier.Deschide("webv-st.txt");
      IF h >= 0 THEN
        ReadLine(h, line);
        IF now - tWebStart > 1500 THEN   (* what the box said before this site does not count *)
          Word(line, 0, w);
          IF Num(w) = 0 THEN webOn := FALSE; down := TRUE; moved := TRUE   (* closed with the phone's BACK key *)
          ELSE
            Word(line, 1, w); webProg := Num(w); Word(line, 2, w); webBack := Num(w);
            ReadLine(h, line); IF line[0] # 0X THEN Copy(line, webUrl) END
          END
        END;
        Fisier.Gata(h)
      END
    END
  END PollWeb;

  PROCEDURE WebFrame(isDown: BOOLEAN; x, y: INTEGER);   (* the box shows the site; Nora draws around it *)
    VAR s: ARRAY LL OF CHAR; i: INTEGER;
  BEGIN
    PollWeb; Poll;
    IF isDown & ~down THEN down := TRUE; moved := FALSE; x0 := x; y0 := y
    ELSIF isDown THEN IF (ABS(y - y0) > 14) OR (ABS(x - x0) > 14) THEN moved := TRUE END
    ELSIF down THEN
      down := FALSE;
      IF ~moved & (y0 >= H - 84) THEN
        i := x0 * 4 DIV W;
        IF i = 0 THEN IF webBack = 1 THEN WebCmd("back") ELSE WebCmd("hide"); webOn := FALSE END
        ELSIF i = 1 THEN WebCmd("hide"); webOn := FALSE
        ELSIF i = 2 THEN WebCmd("reload")
        ELSE   (* the film to NewPipe; another site to the phone's own app for it *)
          IF IsTube(webUrl) THEN Copy("app org.schabi.newpipe ", s) ELSE Copy("app - ", s) END;
          Add(s, webUrl); WebCmd(s)
        END
      END
    END;
    IF webOn THEN
      OllGL6.Incepe(Desk6.bg);
      OllGL6.Dreptunghi2D(0, TOP, W, H - 84 - TOP, OllGL6.RGB(0, 0, 0));   (* under the box *)
      OllGL6.Dreptunghi2D(0, 0, W, TOP - 4, Desk6.bg);
      Desk6.Header("", "");
      Say2(24, 54, name, 4, Desk6.text); Say2(W - 220, 66, "WHOLE WEB", 2, Desk6.Accent());
      OllGL6.Rotund2D(16, 104, W - 32, 54, 27, Desk6.surface);
      OllGL6.Cerc2D(46, 131, 9, gold); OllGL6.Cerc2D(46, 131, 5, Desk6.surface);
      Copy(webUrl, s); i := Find(s, "://", 0); IF (i > 0) & (i < 10) THEN Cut(s, 0, i + 3) END;
      IF Starts(s, "www.") THEN Cut(s, 0, 4) ELSIF Starts(s, "m.") THEN Cut(s, 0, 2) END;
      Short(s, (W - 100) DIV 12); Say2(68, 124, s, 2, Desk6.text);
      IF (webProg > 0) & (webProg < 100) THEN OllGL6.Rotund2D(40, 150, (W - 80) * webProg DIV 100, 4, 2, Desk6.Accent()) END;
      OllGL6.Dreptunghi2D(0, H - 80, W, 160, Desk6.dark);
      FOR i := 0 TO 3 DO OllGL6.Rotund2D((2 * i + 1) * W DIV 8 - 56, H - 62, 112, 44, 22, panel) END;
      Desk6.Centre(W DIV 8, H - 46, "BACK", 2, Desk6.text); Desk6.Centre(3 * W DIV 8, H - 46, "CLOSE", 2, Desk6.text);
      Desk6.Centre(5 * W DIV 8, H - 46, "RELOAD", 2, Desk6.text);
      IF IsTube(webUrl) THEN Desk6.Centre(7 * W DIV 8, H - 46, "NEWPIPE", 2, Desk6.Accent()) ELSE Desk6.Centre(7 * W DIV 8, H - 46, "APP", 2, Desk6.text) END;
      OllGL6.Arata
    ELSE Draw
    END
  END WebFrame;

  PROCEDURE Frame*(isDown: BOOLEAN; x, y: INTEGER): INTEGER;   (* -1 HOME *)
    VAR r, i, lim: INTEGER; t: ARRAY LL OF CHAR;
  BEGIN
    r := 0;
    IF editing THEN EditFrame(isDown, x, y)
    ELSIF viewing THEN ViewFrame(isDown, x, y)
    ELSIF dlSt = -1 THEN dlSt := 0; StartDl(dlUrl); Draw
    ELSIF pendPlay[0] # 0X THEN PlayMedia(pendPlay, IsAudio(pendPlay)); pendPlay[0] := 0X; PlayerFrame(isDown, x, y)
    ELSIF playing THEN PlayerFrame(isDown, x, y)
    ELSIF webOn THEN WebFrame(isDown, x, y)
    ELSIF tabsOn THEN TabsFrame(isDown, x, y)
    ELSIF menuOn THEN MenuFrame(isDown, x, y)
    ELSE
      Poll;
      IF isDown & ~down THEN
        down := TRUE; moved := FALSE; x0 := x; y0 := y; scroll0 := scroll; hw := -1; tDown := Ceas.Ms(); longDone := FALSE;
        IF (y0 >= TOP) & (y0 < H - 84) THEN hw := WordAt(x0, y0, FALSE) END
      ELSIF isDown THEN
        IF (ABS(y - y0) > 14) OR (ABS(x - x0) > 14) THEN moved := TRUE END;
        IF ~moved & ~longDone & (Ceas.Ms() - tDown >= 600) THEN LongPress(x0, y0); longDone := TRUE; moved := TRUE; hw := -1 END;
        IF moved & (y0 >= TOP) & (y0 < H - 84) THEN scroll := scroll0 + y - y0 END
      ELSIF down THEN
        down := FALSE;
        IF ~moved THEN
          IF finding & (y0 >= H - 144) & (y0 < H - 88) THEN   (* the bar of find *)
            IF x0 >= W - 80 THEN ClearHits
            ELSIF x0 >= W - 150 THEN curHit := (curHit + 1) MOD nHit; JumpHit
            ELSIF x0 >= W - 220 THEN curHit := (curHit + nHit - 1) MOD nHit; JumpHit
            END
          ELSIF y0 >= H - 84 THEN
            IF x0 < W DIV 3 THEN Back
            ELSIF x0 < 2 * W DIV 3 THEN IF alone THEN Go("nora:history", TRUE) ELSE r := -1 END
            ELSE Go("nora:start", TRUE)
            END
          ELSIF (y0 >= 44) & (y0 < 96) & (x0 >= W - 224) THEN   (* A- A+ *)
            IF x0 < W - 120 THEN IF ts > 2 THEN DEC(ts) END ELSIF ts < 4 THEN INC(ts) END;
            SaveSize; Layout
          ELSIF (y0 >= 44) & (y0 < 96) & (x0 >= W - 330) THEN ToggleMark   (* the star *)
          ELSIF (y0 >= 40) & (y0 < 100) & (x0 >= 150) & (x0 < 214) THEN SaveTab; tabsOn := TRUE   (* the tabs *)
          ELSIF (y0 >= 100) & (y0 < 162) THEN
            editing := TRUE; kdown := FALSE; Keys1.Reset; ef := -1;
            IF state = asking THEN Copy(want, edit) ELSE Copy(url, edit) END;
            IF Same(edit, "nora:start") THEN edit[0] := 0X END;
            ecur := Len(edit)
          ELSIF y0 >= TOP THEN
            i := WordAt(x0, y0, FALSE);
            IF i >= 0 THEN
              IF wK[i] = kImg THEN
                IF (wA[i] >= 0) & (Starts(links[wA[i]], "nora:play?") OR IsMedia(links[wA[i]])) THEN   (* a picture of a film: play it *)
                  Copy(links[wA[i]], t); IF IsMedia(t) THEN PlayMedia(t, IsAudio(t)) ELSE Go(t, TRUE) END
                ELSIF iSt[wS[i]] = 3 THEN OpenView(i) ELSIF wA[i] >= 0 THEN Copy(links[wA[i]], t); Go(t, TRUE)
                END
              ELSIF wK[i] = kVid THEN PlayMedia(mdUrl[wS[i]], mdAud[wS[i]])
              ELSIF wF[i] >= 0 THEN FieldTap(wF[i])
              ELSE
                Copy(links[wA[i]], t);
                IF IsMedia(t) THEN PlayMedia(t, IsAudio(t))   (* a link to a film plays it *)
                ELSIF IsFile(t) THEN StartDl(t)   (* a link to a file keeps it *)
                ELSE Go(t, TRUE)
                END
              END
            END
          END
        END;
        hw := -1
      END;
      lim := (H - 84 - TOP) - totalH; IF lim > 0 THEN lim := 0 END;
      IF scroll > 0 THEN scroll := 0 ELSIF scroll < lim THEN scroll := lim END;
      Draw
    END
    RETURN r
  END Frame;

  PROCEDURE Enter*;   (* the finger that opened NORA does not press anything *)
  BEGIN down := TRUE; moved := TRUE; IF url[0] = 0X THEN url := "nora:start"; StartPage END
  END Enter;

  PROCEDURE SetName*(s: ARRAY OF CHAR);   (* what she is called: "Nora" unless told *)
  BEGIN Copy(s, name)
  END SetName;

  PROCEDURE Alone*;   (* an app of her own: no HOME behind her *)
  BEGIN alone := TRUE
  END Alone;

  PROCEDURE Start*(w, h: INTEGER);
  BEGIN W := w; H := h; LoadSize; LoadMarks; LoadHist; LoadSaved
  END Start;

  PROCEDURE InitHits;
    VAR i: INTEGER;
  BEGIN FOR i := 0 TO NW - 1 DO wHit[i] := FALSE END
  END InitHits;

  PROCEDURE InitPics;
    VAR i: INTEGER;
  BEGIN FOR i := 0 TO NI - 1 DO iSt[i] := 0; iUse[i] := -1; iUrl[i][0] := 0X; iTex[i] := FALSE END
  END InitPics;

BEGIN
  W := 1; H := 1; np := 0; nw := 0; nl := 0; nr := 0; totalH := 0; nh := 0; state := idle; reqId := 0; tMsg := 0;
  url[0] := 0X; base[0] := 0X; title[0] := 0X; want[0] := 0X; edit[0] := 0X; msg[0] := 0X; ecur := 0; scroll := 0; hw := -1;
  down := FALSE; moved := FALSE; editing := FALSE; kdown := FALSE; pushed := -2; inA := -1;
  nextSlot := 0; curSlot := -1; teeH := -1; posting := FALSE; src := "net.html"; nmk := 0; ef := -1; pasteT := 0; tDown := 0; longDone := FALSE;
  nhi := 0; nHit := 0; curHit := 0; fWords := 1; finding := FALSE; dlSt := 0; dlSize := 0; fq[0] := 0X; InitHits;
  playing := FALSE; pendPlay[0] := 0X; plSt := 0; plPos := 0; plDur := 0; tPl := 0; tPlStart := 0; nmd := 0; inMedia := FALSE;
  viewing := FALSE; vSlot := 0; vLink := -1; vSt := 0; vCw := 0; vCh := 0; vTex := FALSE; name := "Nora"; alone := FALSE;
  resolving := FALSE; resWant[0] := 0X;
  ntab := 1; ctab := 0; tabsOn := FALSE; menuOn := FALSE; menuUrl[0] := 0X; menuKind := 1;
  priv := FALSE; desk := FALSE; tPriv[0] := FALSE; resWatch[0] := 0X; fallWeb[0] := 0X; nsv := 0;
  tUrl[0][0] := 0X; tTitle[0][0] := 0X; tSlot[0] := -1; tScroll[0] := 0; tNh[0] := 0;
  webOn := FALSE; webUrl[0] := 0X; webProg := 0; webBack := 0; tWeb := 0; tWebStart := 0;
  pageGen := 0; imgId := 1000000; imgSlot := 0; tImg := 0; tImgPoll := 0; imgBusy := FALSE; refreshAt := 0; nRefresh := 0;
  InitPics;
  nfo := 0; nf := 0; no := 0; curForm := -1; inSelect := -1; inOption := -1; inButton := -1; optHasVal := FALSE;
  linkc := OllGL6.RGB(125, 211, 252); press := OllGL6.RGB(56, 32, 92); panel := OllGL6.RGB(52, 22, 86);
  white := OllGL6.RGB(240, 235, 250); gold := OllGL6.RGB(212, 160, 23); red := OllGL6.RGB(239, 68, 68);
  muted := OllGL6.RGB(150, 140, 175); bgk := OllGL6.RGB(14, 4, 28); ts := 2;
  hitNow := OllGL6.RGB(170, 110, 0); hitOld := OllGL6.RGB(80, 60, 20); Font
END Nora18.
